msgid "**Break-glass editing:** the backend is break-glass only, and so is a local site session of the bootstrap administrator or of an account holding `core.admin`, signed in with a password through `?fallback=local`: they edit every field of every account, and the next Keycloak login of an SSO account overwrites what Keycloak manages again. The console (`cli/joomla.php`) is not guarded either."
