msgid "**Directory role alignment:** [files/python/align_ldap_users.py](./files/python/align_ldap_users.py) runs with the members of both role groups as a container hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/), at every deploy and on its timer. It regroups the accounts that sign in only through `LDAP`, re-enables returning members and disables accounts outside both groups. The owner, the MCP account and every other local account stay untouched."
