# Majukumu sasa yanaweza kutumika katika majeshi mengi badala ya kuwa mdogo
# kwa stack moja ya Compose. mpya mpya mpya mpya *svc-swarm-node* kuanzisha
# bendi hiyo, wakati *svc-swarm-manager* Inawakilisha mameneja wa Raft katika
# hesabu. Serikali ya Muungano kwa kushirikiana *svc-storage-nfs-server*
# Aidha, na *svc-storage-nfs-client*... *svc-registry-docker* kujenga majengo
# yaliyojengwa na wananchi, na *svc-registry-cache* Inatoa cache ya kuvuta Hub
# ya Docker ili nodes za ziada hazizidi kuvuta nje na matumizi ya kiwango cha
# chini. Uhamisho, azimio la utegemezi, mitandao, hundi za afya na templates
# za jukumu sasa zinaelewa wote wa Compose na Swarm semantics. kuona kuwa
# [svc-swarm-node](roles/svc-swarm-node/README.md) Aidha, na
# [svc-storage-nfs-server](roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/README.md) ya kusoma.
msgid "**Docker Swarm as a second deployment mode.** Roles can now be deployed across multiple hosts instead of being limited to a single Compose stack. New *svc-swarm-node* initializes the cluster, while *svc-swarm-manager* marks the Raft managers in the inventory. Shared state is provided through *svc-storage-nfs-server* and *svc-storage-nfs-client*. *svc-registry-docker* distributes locally built images, and *svc-registry-cache* provides a Docker Hub pull-through cache so additional nodes do not multiply external pulls and rate-limit usage. Deployment, dependency resolution, networking, health checks and role templates now understand both Compose and Swarm semantics. See the [svc-swarm-node](roles/svc-swarm-node/README.md) and [svc-storage-nfs-server](roles/svc-storage-nfs-server/README.md) READMEs."
msgstr ""

# ambalo kikundi cha Ansible kinaorodhesha zaidi ya mwenyeji mmoja. Kundi hilo
# linaongozwa na `svc-swarm-node` is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is
# is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is is
# is is is is is is is is is is is is is `groups[application_id]` moja kwa
# moja. Jukumu na majeshi moja au sifuri katika kikundi chake hukaa kwenye
# njia ya Compose iliyopo na hutoa pato la kawaida. (Hakuna uhamiaji haramu).
# Kuongeza majeshi ya ziada kwa kikundi cha jukumu mwenyewe ni kuchochea moja
# ambayo inakuza jukumu la huduma ya Swarm.
msgid "**Docker Swarm deployment mode** for any role whose own Ansible group lists more than one host. The cluster is bootstrapped by the `svc-swarm-node` group; per-role topology is derived from `groups[application_id]` directly. A role with one or zero hosts in its group stays on the existing Compose path and renders byte-identical output (no implicit migration). Adding additional hosts to a role's own group is the single trigger that promotes the role to a Swarm service."
msgstr ""

# env-file-msingi (Hakuna mabadiliko ya app). Uhamiaji kwa ajili ya `docker
# secret` (ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed ed
