msgid "**Eligibility is read from LiteLLM's own catalog; a declaration is the override.** The image ships `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 models deep, carrying `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` and `input_cost_per_token`. The hook reads a route's capabilities from `litellm.model_cost`, keyed on the route's own `litellm_params.model` and then on that name without its first segment, because `ollama/llama3` is filed prefixed while `openai/gpt-4o-mini` is filed as `gpt-4o-mini`. It never probes a backend at request time."
msgstr "**Uhalali ni kusoma kutoka orodha ya LiteLLM mwenyewe; tamko ni override.** Picha ya meli `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, Kwa hivyo, 1595 Mifano ya hali ya juu, ambayo `max_input_tokens`, Kwa hivyo, `supports_vision`, Kwa hivyo, `supports_function_calling` Aidha, na `input_cost_per_token`· Serikali inatambua uwezo wa barabara kutoka `litellm.model_cost`, Kuwa na uhakika juu ya njia yako mwenyewe `litellm_params.model` na badala yake jina la kwanza, kwa sababu `ollama/llama3` Imetolewa kabla ya `openai/gpt-4o-mini` Imetolewa kama `gpt-4o-mini`· Kamwe usitafute njia ya mkato kwa wakati."

