# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**File creation via shell heredoc is FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NOT use `cat > file <<EOF … EOF` or any variant (`tee > file <<EOF`, `printf \"…\" > file`, `echo \"…\" > file` for multi-line content) to create or overwrite files. Use the **Write tool**. For editing an existing file, use **Edit**, not `sed -i`/`awk -i`. Reason: Write/Edit land structured in the transcript and diff; heredoc + redirect shapes also fall out of the auto-allow heuristic and drop into ask."
msgstr "**Kuundwa kwa faili kupitia shell heredoc ni FORBIDDEN. ⛔** Sio lazima kutumia `cat > file <<EOF … EOF` au aina yoyote ya tofauti (`tee > file <<EOF`, Kwa hivyo, `printf \"…\" > file`, Kwa hivyo, `echo \"…\" > file` Kwa maudhui ya multi-line) Kujenga au kufuta faili. Matumizi ya **Kuandika chombo**Kwa ajili ya kuhariri faili zilizopo, kutumia **Edit Edit Edit**Hapana, si ya `sed -i`Kwa hivyo`awk -i`. Sababu: Andika /Edit ardhi muundo katika nakala na usambazaji; maumbo heredoc + redirect pia kuanguka nje ya heuristic auto-kuruhusu na kushuka katika kuuliza."

