# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed**"
msgstr "**Waliochaguliwa**"

# preload *Ufafanuzi wa CustomField* Kabla ya kabla ya *Tag: yakima*).
# nextcloud LDAP config ngumu na programu zisizoendana walemavu katika
# uzalishaji. XWiki ugani kufunga ngumu na wakati mmoja mbegu kuhakikisha
# *Main.WebHome* kuwepo. Matomo bootstrap inashindwa haraka kwa sababu ya
# mizizi. TLS na maboresho yake (self umoja saini CA env kwa huduma za afya,
# retries kwa CA uaminifu override kizazi, Nix TLS CA uaminifu fix)... *wa wa
# wa wa* Bora juu ya Fedora. Ufunguzi wa *T-shirt ya T-shirt* Kujenga mahitaji
# na kuanguka kwa kichwa; kwa mtumiaji *password_update* kisiasa aliongeza.
# Backups na ufumbuzi wa ops (OnlyOffice Hakuna kuanzisha tena wakati wa
# chelezo; kazi za nyumbani na ACL za kuaminika zaidi)Ufungaji wa chombo ni
# ngumu (Fedora Docker CE CLI, Dnf5 Repo kuongeza, Debian kujengax migogoro
# kurekebisha, utayari Docker na SSH kuanzisha upya maboresho)...
msgid "**Fixed:** OpenProject migrations stabilized (simplified migration step; preload *CustomFieldContext* before *db:migrate*). Nextcloud LDAP config hardened and incompatible apps disabled in production. XWiki extension install hardened and one time seed ensures *Main.WebHome* exists. Matomo bootstrap fails fast on root cause. TLS and CA improvements (unified self signed CA env for health services, retries for CA trust override generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* improved on Fedora. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* build prerequisites and header fallback refactored; per user *password_update* policy added. Backup and ops fixes (OnlyOffice no restart during backups; backup home and ACL tasks more reliable). Container setup hardened (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo add, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker readiness and SSH restart improvements)."
msgstr ""

