msgstr "**Kwa watumiaji**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**For searching file contents, use the Grep tool.** If shelling out is unavoidable, use a single `grep` invocation with multiple file arguments (e.g. `grep -nE 'pattern' file1 file2 file3`) or a recursive call with a path/glob (e.g. `grep -rnE 'pattern' path/`)."
msgstr "**Kwa kutafuta maudhui ya faili, tumia chombo cha Grep.** Ikiwa udongo hauwezi kukauka, tumia moja `grep` Kuchanganya na hoja nyingi za faili (ya g. `grep -nE 'pattern' file1 file2 file3`) au kutuma maombi ya kazi kwa njia ya posta. (ya g. `grep -rnE 'pattern' path/`)..."

msgid "**Force Execution Mode:** When `CLEANUP=true`, cleanup is executed immediately."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Force Execution Mode:** When ``CLEANUP=true``, cleanup is executed immediately."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Foreign deploy source.** The deploy template deploys from an inventory repository bound as a Semaphore repository. Private repositories are supported and are the default; the repository URL and its deploy key are mandatory inventory values with no default. The Semaphore test variant includes `web-app-gitea`, which hosts a private inventory repository for the `target` service."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fork identity** for the operator's CI-redeploy shortcuts: `INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT` (defaults to the local OS username) and `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_URL` (composed as `https://github.com/$INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT/$INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`), both set by handlers under `utils/env/handlers/infinito/` (`fork_account.py`, `fork_repository_url.py`). The fork repository name itself lives in `default.env` as `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`."
msgstr "**utambulisho wa** Njia za mkato za CI-redeploy: `INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT` (Chagua jina la mtumiaji wa ndani wa OS) Aidha, na `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_URL` (Kuundwa kama `https://github.com/$INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT/$INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`)zote mbili kwa kushirikiana na watendaji `utils/env/handlers/infinito/` (`fork_account.py`, Kwa hivyo, `fork_repository_url.py`)Jina lake la kuzaliwa linahifadhiwa katika `default.env` Kama vile `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Foundation for Further Stacks:** Ideal starting point for Flask, Django, scientific computing, and automation."
msgstr "**Msingi wa Stacks zaidi:** Njia bora ya kuanza kwa Flask, Django, kompyuta ya kisayansi, na automatisering."

msgid "**Four eyes:** when ``services.access-request.four_eyes`` is ``true``, a grant needs two different approvers. It grants only the roles both kept selected."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Four eyes:** when `services.access-request.four_eyes` is `true`, a grant needs two different approvers. It grants only the roles both kept selected."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Frame.** The header box and the footer box get side borders. The header box rounds its bottom corners and the footer box its top corners. Each corner's radius is `min(R, distance from the box edge to the nearest card under that corner)`, so a card that reaches the edge meets a square corner and closes flush, and the radius grows back in the gap between card rows. `R` comes from the corporate design's large radius."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Front proxy and group gate:** The UI is reached only through the front proxy on port 443, behind an OAuth2 proxy that admits only members of this role's administrator group. The SSO flags turn on as soon as any inventory host runs `web-app-keycloak`, and the deploy refuses to run while they resolve to false."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Front proxy and group gate:** The UI is reached only through the front proxy on port 443, behind an OAuth2 proxy that admits only members of this role’s administrator group. The SSO flags turn on as soon as any inventory host runs ``web-app-keycloak``, and the deploy refuses to run while they resolve to false."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Front proxy is triggered by OpenResty.** An application gets a vhost exactly when its own `meta/services.yml` enables and shares `openresty`. Today no application declares that key (only `svc-prx-openresty` does), so every role that needs a vhost gets the new key."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Front-proxy integration:** Publish the app through ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` for TLS termination and per-domain routing."
msgstr "**Ushirikiano wa Pre-proxy:** Tumia app hii kupitia ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` Kuondolewa kwa TLS na uendeshaji wa kila uwanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Front-proxy integration:** Publish the app through `sys-stk-front-proxy` for TLS termination and per-domain routing."
msgstr "**Ushirikiano wa Pre-proxy:** Tumia app hii kupitia `sys-stk-front-proxy` Kuondolewa kwa TLS na uendeshaji wa kila uwanja."

msgid "**Frontend and backend.** Every role is styled and tested on its frontend and, where the app has one, on its separate backend (admin surface such as `wp-admin`, the Shopware or Magento admin, the Joomla administrator). A role with a backend shows backend views in its gallery in addition to the frontend views, and its Playwright spec covers both surfaces."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full Unicode support**: `utf8mb4` is the only MySQL/MariaDB character set that fully implements 4‑byte UTF‑8, allowing storage of emojis, supplementary symbols, and all global scripts without data loss."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full extraction set:** the `-full` image ships the OCR and language detection dependencies, so scanned documents are extracted too."
msgstr "**Ufungaji kamili:** Kwa kuwa `-full` Picha meli OCR na lugha kutambua dependencies, hivyo nyaraka scanned ni kuondolewa pia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full extraction set:** the ``-full`` image ships the OCR and language detection dependencies, so scanned documents are extracted too."
msgstr "**Ufungaji kamili:** Kwa kuwa ``-full`` Picha meli OCR na lugha kutambua dependencies, hivyo nyaraka scanned ni kuondolewa pia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full onion node**: `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` = node `.onion`; entire stack shifts together. No web/identity split, no domain-transform lookup."
msgstr "**Maelezo ya mchezo Node**: `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` ya node `.onion`; Kila kitu kinabadilika kwa pamoja. Hakuna mgawanyiko wa wavuti / utambulisho, hakuna utaftaji wa kikoa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Automated Setup:** The role handles all tasks, including pulling the source repository, building the Docker image, and serving the presentation through a web server."
msgstr "**Ufungaji kamili:** Jukumu linashughulikia kazi zote, ikiwa ni pamoja na kuunganisha hazina ya chanzo, kujenga picha ya Docker, na kutumikia uwasilishaji kupitia seva ya wavuti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized Deployment:** Simplifies installation using Docker Compose for the Nextcloud application and its MariaDB backend."
msgstr "**Utoaji kamili:** Kuboresha miundombinu kwa kutumia Docker Compose Kwa ajili ya Nextcloud utekelezaji wake na MariaDB ya nyuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (``confluence_data``) and a slim overlay image for future add-ons."
msgstr "**Udanganyifu kamili:** Kuunganisha stack na kiasi cha data kilichojitolea (``confluence_data``) na picha ndogo ya overlay kwa nyongeza ya baadaye."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (``jira_data``) and a minimal overlay image to enable future plugins/config."
msgstr "**Udanganyifu kamili:** Kuunganisha stack na kiasi cha data kilichojitolea (``jira_data``) na picha ndogo ya overlay ili kuwezesha Plugins ya baadaye /config."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (`confluence_data`) and a slim overlay image for future add-ons."
msgstr "**Udanganyifu kamili:** Kuunganisha stack na kiasi cha data kilichojitolea (`confluence_data`) na picha ndogo ya overlay kwa nyongeza ya baadaye."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (`jira_data`) and a minimal overlay image to enable future plugins/config."
msgstr "**Udanganyifu kamili:** Kuunganisha stack na kiasi cha data kilichojitolea (`jira_data`) na picha ndogo ya overlay ili kuwezesha Plugins ya baadaye /config."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Future‑proof:** Modern applications and standards have converged on UTF‑8; using `utf8mb4` avoids migration challenges later."
msgstr "**Ushahidi wa baadaye:** Maombi ya kisasa na viwango vimeunganishwa kwenye UTF-8; Kwa kutumia `utf8mb4` Kutatua changamoto za uhamiaji baadaye."

msgid "**GPU**: a container reaches the card only with `NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES` set, since `runtime: nvidia` alone injects nothing. Compose only; swarm has no GPU path."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Game Visibility:** Matches and moves can appear in social timelines."
msgstr "**Mchezo uwezekano:** Mechi na hatua zinaweza kuonekana katika nyakati za kijamii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gantt Charts & Timelines:** Visualize project schedules and dependencies using intuitive Gantt charts and timeline views, enabling effective planning and resource allocation."
msgstr "**Chati za Gantt na Timelines:** Kuangalia ratiba za mradi na hutegemea kwa kutumia chati za Gantt na maoni ya muda, kuwezesha mipango bora na ugawaji wa rasilimali."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway backend:** The LiteLLM Gateway publishes those aliases, which are the names Ollama serves too, so the same model name routes to whichever local backend a deployment runs."
msgstr "**Mlango wa nyuma:** Kwa kuwa LiteLLM Gateway majina hayo, ambayo ni majina ya Ollama Pia hutumikia, kwa hivyo jina la mfano lina njia za kila mahali nyuma ya kupelekwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway credentials:** Without Keycloak, access is gated by the LiteLLM UI username and password that the LiteLLM Gateway provisions. That pair keeps working alongside SSO as a break-glass login."
