msgid "**Keys:** The deploy signs in to every host the inventory lists as ``root`` with the ``deploy_ssh_key`` credential, so authorize its public half for ``root`` there. It is a key of its own: the ``app_control_ssh_key`` credential reaches only the ``app-control`` account of the Semaphore host through its forced command and never leaves that host. Every key is stored under a name that ends in its fingerprint, so the deploy that brings a rotated key stores it next to its predecessor and removes the predecessor. The vault password is a Semaphore secret of the deploy environment, whose name ends in a digest keyed with the deploy key, so a changed password replaces the environment the same way."
msgstr ""

