msgid "**Mini-QR** is a lightweight, self-hosted web application for generating QR codes instantly and privately.   It provides a minimal and elegant interface to convert any text, URL, or message into a QR code directly in your browser, without external tracking or dependencies."
msgstr "**Mini-QR** Ni programu nyepesi, ya kujitegemea ya kuunda nambari za QR mara moja na kwa faragha. Inatoa interface ndogo na ya kifahari kubadilisha maandishi yoyote, URL, au ujumbe katika msimbo wa QR moja kwa moja kwenye kivinjari chako, bila kufuatilia nje au utegemezi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal NGINX Setup:** Clean and optimized default configurations."
msgstr "**Ufungaji wa NGINX:** Mipangilio ya default na optimized."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal Setup:** No unnecessary dependencies are installed."
msgstr "**Ufungaji mdogo:** Hakuna mahitaji yasiyo ya lazima yamefanywa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal footprint:** Does not enable services or autostart entries beyond what the package itself provides."
msgstr "**Miguu ya chini:** Hairuhusu huduma au viingilio vya autostart zaidi ya mfuko yenyewe hutoa."

# gained=['Node.jsHuduma']
# ndogo Node.jsHuduma ya Express ambayo inafaa vizuri katika stacks kubwa.
msgid "**Minimal footprint:** Small Node.js/Express service that fits neatly into larger stacks."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal scope** (client-only, no server configuration)"
msgstr "**Kiwango cha chini** (server ya kawaida, hakuna server)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mirror failover:** A repository that declares a mirror is served through a guarded location: a 5xx from its primary remote re-runs the same path against the sibling repository, while a 404 is passed straight back."
msgstr "**Picha ya skrini:** Hifadhi ambayo inatangaza kioo hutumiwa kupitia eneo lililohifadhiwa: 5xx kutoka kwa kijijini chake cha msingi kinaendesha njia sawa dhidi ya hifadhi ya ndugu, wakati 404 Inarudi moja kwa moja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Image-level mutation (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) and their synonyms (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) still route through `ask`, so the operator reviews them before they execute."
msgstr "**Kupunguza:** Mabadiliko ya kiwango cha picha (`run`, Kwa hivyo, `build`, Kwa hivyo, `push`, Kwa hivyo, `login`) na mahusiano yao. (`docker container run`, Kwa hivyo, `docker image build`, Kwa hivyo, `docker buildx build`, Kwa hivyo, `docker image push`) Bado njia ya kupitia `ask`, Kwa hiyo, mwendeshaji anakagua kabla ya kutekeleza."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Targets still cannot bypass `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, or the `deny` list. A malicious target that called `rm -rf .` would be stopped by the `rm -rf*` deny rule."
msgstr "**Kupunguza:** Malengo bado hayawezi kufikiwa `allowWrite`, Kwa hivyo, `allowedDomains`, au ya `deny` Orodha ya. Mradi huo ambao uliitwa `rm -rf .` itakuwa imefungwa na `rm -rf*` Kukataa utawala."

# `ask`, Kwa hiyo, Kamati inawaangalia (Kwa kuzingatia dhana 5). ya ya ya ya
# `deny` Orodha ya vitalu `sudo*`, Kwa hiyo, ni muhimu sana kuongeza mapato
# kupitia `sudo` Haiwezekani.
msgid "**Mitigation:** `docker run*` and its synonyms are in `ask`, so the operator reviews them (subject to Assumption 5). The `deny` list blocks `sudo*`, so direct privilege escalation via `sudo` is unavailable."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `sandbox.enabled: true` with `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` refuses to start when the backend is unavailable. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` rejects the `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` tool parameter, so there is no per-call escape."
msgstr "**Kupunguza:** `sandbox.enabled: true` Pamoja na `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` Kukataa kuanza wakati nyuma haipatikani. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` Wakataa kuwa `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` Chombo cha parameter, kwa hivyo hakuna kutoroka kwa simu."

msgid "**Mobilizon identity:** the bridge publishes as the platform administrator through Mobilizon's database login, which is off whenever Mobilizon's native login method is off. The sidecar parses records any platform PDS user can write while it holds the global administrator password, so a dedicated bridge account replaces this before `alpha` (operator, 2026-11-04)."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Mode presets.** `clearnet` = {clearnet}, `tor` = {onion}, `multi` = {clearnet, onion}."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-aware:** absent optional sources are skipped, not failed, so the same role works in both self-signed and Let's Encrypt setups."
msgstr "**Kuwa na ufahamu:** Vyanzo visivyo vya hiari vimeruka, sio kushindwa, kwa hivyo jukumu hilo hilo hufanya kazi katika vipengele vyote viwili vya kujitegemea na Hebu Turuhusu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-aware:** absent optional sources are skipped, not failed, so the same role works in both self-signed and Let’s Encrypt setups."
msgstr "**Kuwa na ufahamu:** Vyanzo visivyo vya hiari vimeruka, sio kushindwa, kwa hivyo jukumu hilo hilo hufanya kazi katika vipengele vyote viwili vya kujitegemea na Hebu Turuhusu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in ``svc-swarm-node`` resolves ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**Uchaguzi wa mode:** Ushiriki katika ``svc-swarm-node`` Uamuzi wa ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` Kwa kila jukumu la programu ya wavuti kwenye mwenyeji huu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in `svc-swarm-node` resolves `DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**Uchaguzi wa mode:** Ushiriki katika `svc-swarm-node` Uamuzi wa `DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm` Kwa kila jukumu la programu ya wavuti kwenye mwenyeji huu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Model and context:** ``agents.model`` names the gateway alias every agent runs on and defaults to the gateway’s chat model, so agents can run on a larger model than Open WebUI’s default. The context window of that alias comes from the model’s ``context`` in the inventory and is written into the agent config as Hermes ``model.context_length`` and OpenClaw ``contextWindow``. An agent prompt runs to tens of thousands of tokens, so a CPU-only local model spends minutes per turn on it; point ``agents.model`` at a remote model for interactive use. Hermes refuses a window below 64000 tokens and answers HTTP 500 on every prompt, so a platform whose minimum the selected alias misses is not offered at all: it is left out of ``/v1/models`` and answers 404, and the deploy says which platform it dropped and why. The rest of the broker keeps working, which is what makes a small model and OpenClaw a valid pairing. An alias that declares no window is reported instead of filtered, because an agent that does not know its window runs."
msgstr "**Mfano na muktadha:** ``agents.model`` majina ya lango alias kila wakala anaendesha juu na defaults kwa njia ya lango chat mfano, hivyo mawakala wanaweza kukimbia juu ya mfano mkubwa kuliko Open WebUIya kushindwa. Muonekano wa dirisha hilo la Alias linatokana na mtindo wa ``context`` katika hesabu na imeandikwa katika config wakala kama Hermes ``model.context_length`` Aidha, na OpenClaw ``contextWindow``. Wakala wa haraka anaendesha kwa makumi ya maelfu ya ishara, kwa hivyo mfano wa ndani wa CPU tu hutumia dakika kwa kugeuka juu yake. ``agents.model`` kwa kutumia mfumo wa kielektroniki kwa ajili ya matumizi. Lowassa akataa kuachia ngazi 64000 Vidokezo na Majibu ya HTTP 500 juu ya kila haraka, hivyo jukwaa ambalo angalau alias kuchaguliwa amekosa si zinazotolewa wakati wote: ni kushoto nje ya ``/v1/models`` Majibu ya 404, na kupelekwa anasema jukwaa gani imeshuka na kwa nini. Kwa upande mwingine, kampuni hiyo inafanya kazi, ambayo inafanya kazi ndogo na OpenClaw Kuwa na jozi sahihi. Alias ambayo inatangaza hakuna dirisha limeripotiwa badala ya kuchuja, kwa sababu wakala ambaye hajui anaendesha dirisha lake."

