# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never a plain container, and the deploy proves it.** A preflight probes the host for `/dev/kvm` and for each runtime's binary, and selects the strongest runtime that is actually installed; the choice is logged at deploy time. It MUST NOT fall back to a plain `runc` container: unisolated execution of model-generated code is never allowed."
msgstr "**Kamwe hakuna chombo cha wazi, na kupelekwa kunathibitisha.** Kwa upande wake Mkurugenzi wa Halmashauri ya `/dev/kvm` Na kwa kila binary ya runtime, na huchagua runtime yenye nguvu ambayo imewekwa; chaguo ni watumiaji wakati wa kupeleka. Haipaswi kurudi nyuma kwa wazi `runc` Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi. ...................................................................."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never commit your API token to a public repository. Always keep it secure!**"
msgstr "**Kamwe usitoe ahadi zako API kutoa taarifa kwa umma. Daima kuwa salama!**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Never disable.** Required by almost every app."
msgstr "**Kamwe usidharau.** Inahitaji karibu kila app."

