# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No configuration without a key:** the file is written only once URL, key and model list are set."
msgstr "**Hakuna ufungaji bila ufunguo:** Faili imeandikwa mara moja tu URL, orodha muhimu na ya mfano imewekwa."

