msgid "**No invented configuration:** the provider setup stays in the application, because its file schema is not documented upstream."
msgstr "**Hakuna maelezo ya kubuni:** Uundaji wa mtoa huduma unakaa katika programu, kwa sababu schema ya faili yake haijaorodheshwa upstream."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**No new secret store.** Any credential an addon needs continues to be declared in [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) `credentials:` and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`."
msgstr "**Hakuna siri mpya.** Mahitaji yoyote ya ziada ya ziada yanaendelea kutangazwa katika [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) `credentials:` Kusoma kupitia `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`..."

