# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-role opt-IN** on a non-swarm host: explicitly rejected. Swarm mode is exclusively triggered by group membership. The per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` override only opts OUT on a swarm host, never opts IN on a non-swarm host."
msgstr "**Chaguo-msingi-msingi** Kwa upande mwingine, makafiri watajuta wakifikiwa na mauti. Mtindo wa Swarm unaongozwa tu na uanachama wa kikundi. Kwa njia ya `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` override tu huchagua nje kwenye jeshi la nzige, kamwe huchagua ndani ya jeshi lisilo la tahadhari."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-role opt-OUT** on a swarm host: a role MAY override `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` in its `vars/main.yml` to stay on the compose path even when the host is in `svc-swarm-node`. Role vars win over `group_vars/all` by Ansible precedence."
msgstr "**Kwa njia ya opt-out** Juu ya mwenyeji wa wingu: jukumu linaweza override `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` Ndani yake `vars/main.yml` kuwa katika hali ya utulivu, hata kama ni katika `svc-swarm-node`. Wachezaji wa Simba wakishinda `group_vars/all` kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-round variant selection.** In round R every primary app uses variant index `R if R < its_variant_count else 0`. So a single-variant app stays on variant 0 in every round, and a 3-variant app in a 5-round deploy follows `0, 1, 2, 0, 0`."
msgstr "**Uchaguzi wa aina mbalimbali.** Kila programu ya msingi hutumia index ya lahaja `R if R < its_variant_count else 0`. Kwa hivyo, programu moja ya kuhifadhi inakaa kwenye lahaja 0 Katika kila hatua, na 3Matumizi ya App katika A 5Hatua za kufuata `0, 1, 2, 0, 0`..."

