msgid "**Role groups:** members of the ``administrator`` role group are superusers, members of ``reviewer`` join the built-in Reviewers team and members of ``manager`` the built-in Managers team; every other account loses the flag and both teams. `files/python/rbac_reconcile.py <./files/python/rbac_reconcile.py>`__ runs as an RBAC hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer; the platform administrator, bots and the anonymous account are never changed, and an account the OIDC sign-in creates is converged on the next run."
