# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Token verified against the hub:** Every deploy asks the hub whether the stored token still authenticates and re-mints it when the hub rejects it, then fails the deploy if the fresh token is rejected too. A hub whose `.storage/auth` was recreated leaves a stored token pointing at a deleted refresh token, and clients would receive a 401 on every call."
msgstr "**Token kuthibitishwa dhidi ya hub:** Kila kupelekwa kuuliza kitovu kama ishara kuhifadhiwa bado inathibitisha na re-mints wakati kitovu anakataa, basi inashindwa kupeleka kama ishara mpya ni kukataliwa pia. Mbunge ambaye `.storage/auth` Iliondolewa kutoka kwa majani yaliyohifadhiwa ambayo yanaashiria ishara ya kuburudisha iliyofutwa, na wateja watapata 401 kwa kila simu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
