# `svc-bkp-container-2-local`...
msgid "**Tor = compose sidecar**, `network_mode: host`, keys on a named volume, restored from the vaulted mint **before** Tor starts. Backup via `svc-bkp-container-2-local`."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Tor and direct lists:** ``egress.tor`` and ``egress.direct`` each carry an ``include`` and an ``except``; entries are host names, ``*.`` wildcards, IPs and CIDRs. A host name covers its subdomains, so ``example.org`` and ``*.example.org`` mean the same. ``except`` only narrows its own ``include``, a destination both lists keep takes Tor, and the route decides everything no list matches. ``.onion`` can never be direct."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Tor and direct lists:** `egress.tor` and `egress.direct` each carry an `include` and an `except`; entries are host names, `*.` wildcards, IPs and CIDRs. A host name covers its subdomains, so `example.org` and `*.example.org` mean the same. `except` only narrows its own `include`, a destination both lists keep takes Tor, and the route decides everything no list matches. `.onion` can never be direct."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Tor as a first-class deployment axis.** The new *svc-net-tor* role routes onion names through Tor via DNS instead of per-app proxies, offers a chutney flavor for private-net test deployments, and ties its dnsmasq listener to ownership rather than the deploy mode. Applications follow: server-side OIDC discovery and token exchange reach plaintext onion issuers through the SOCKS proxy (WordPress, Joomla, PeerTube, Mobilizon, EspoCRM, Nextcloud), session cookies drop the *Secure* flag where an onion cannot carry it (Taiga, Pixelfed, Joomla), and mail authenticates on the submission port the onion relay actually serves. The deploy matrix gained a tor axis with an onion marker plus enforced and exclusive modes, and lint now requires the onion in every variant. See the [svc-net-tor](roles/svc-net-tor/README.md) README."
msgstr "**Kutumika kama mhimili wa kwanza.** Mpya ya *svc-net-tor* Majina ya nafasi ya njia za kuunganisha kupitia Tor kupitia DNS badala ya proxies za programu, hutoa ladha ya chutney kwa kupelekwa kwa majaribio ya kibinafsi, na hufunga msikilizaji wake wa dnsmasq kwa umiliki badala ya hali ya kupeleka. Maombi yafuatayo: Ugunduzi wa upande wa seva wa OIDC na kubadilishana ishara kufikia watoaji wa hoja wazi kupitia wakala wa SOCKS (WordPressKwa hivyo, JoomlaKwa hivyo, PeerTubeKwa hivyo, MobilizonKwa hivyo, EspoCRMKwa hivyo, Nextcloud), Cookies ya mkutano kuacha *Kuwa salama* Bendera ambayo bendera yake haiwezi kuibeba (TaigaKwa hivyo, PixelfedKwa hivyo, Joomla), na barua inathibitisha juu ya uwasilishaji bandari onion relay kweli mtumishi. matrix kupelekwa alipata mhimili tor na alama ya onion pamoja na njia za kutekelezwa na za kipekee, na lint sasa inahitaji onion katika kila lahaja. kuona kuwa [svc-net-tor](roles/svc-net-tor/README.md) ya kusoma."

