msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`svc-ai-litellm` is headless and internal-only; the admin UI is a separate optional `web-app-litellm` role.** The gateway itself exposes no public domain and no LiteLLM admin UI. A distinct `web-app-litellm` role serves the admin interface behind the proxy with SSO, following the standard `web-app-*` contract. Coupling is asymmetric: `web-app-litellm` REQUIRES the gateway (deploying it forces `svc-ai-litellm` to `enabled: true` + `shared: true`), while `svc-ai-litellm` only OPTIONALLY references the UI (via `group_names`) and runs fine without it."
msgstr "**`svc-ai-litellm` Ni kichwa na cha ndani tu; admin UI ni chaguo tofauti `web-app-litellm` majukumu yake.** Mlango yenyewe hufunua kikoa cha umma na hakuna admin ya LiteLLM. Kuwa tofauti `web-app-litellm` jukumu mtumishi interface admin nyuma ya wakala na SSO, kufuatia kiwango `web-app-*` Mkataba wa. Aina ya zabibu ni asymmetric: `web-app-litellm` Kuondoa mlango (Kuweka nguvu `svc-ai-litellm` Kwa kuwa `enabled: true` + + + + + + `shared: true`), Hata hivyo, wakati `svc-ai-litellm` Ni maneno ya kawaida tu ambayo (Kwa kupitia `group_names`) Hufanya vizuri bila ya kufanya hivyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`svc-ai-ollama` stays the default local backend behind the gateway.** No new model-serving stack replaces it; it is registered as a `model_list` entry."
msgstr "**`svc-ai-ollama` Weka nyuma ya default nyuma ya mlango.** Hakuna njia mpya ya kufanya hivyo, na hii ndiyo njia pekee ya kufanya. `model_list` kuingia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`svc-ai-robot` deploys Hermes in embodied mode on a dedicated device.** It reuses the `web-app-hermes` agent from [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) and configures it for privileged hardware access. The trust boundary is the device ([032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Decision #12), so no microVM wraps the agent here."
msgstr "**`svc-ai-robot` Tumia Hermes katika hali iliyojumuishwa kwenye kifaa kilichojitolea.** Inabadilisha matumizi ya `web-app-hermes` Mwakilishi kutoka [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Inaunganisha kwa upatikanaji wa vifaa vya upendeleo. Msingi wa imani ni mfumo ([032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Uamuzi wa #12)Kwa hivyo, hakuna microVM hufunika wakala hapa."

