# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A **variant** is the role's assembled per-role meta payload (the same payload `applications.<app>` exposes; see [layout.md](../../../design/role/services/layout.md)) deep-merged with the matching list entry. The deep-merge follows the same rules as the [`applications`](../plugins/lookup/applications.md) lookup: dictionaries merge recursively, scalars and lists are replaced, and the entry has precedence."
msgstr "A ya **Tofauti ya** Ni sehemu ya jukumu linalokusanywa kwa kila-role meta payload (Malipo sawa `applications.<app>` Bonyeza hapa; Angalia [layout.md](../../../design/role/services/layout.md)) Imeunganishwa na orodha ya kuingia. Sheria hiyo inafuata kanuni kama vile [`applications`](../plugins/lookup/applications.md) Kuangalia: dictionaries kuunganisha recursively, scalars na orodha ni kubadilishwa, na kuingia ina kipaumbele."

