# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A Tor node's resolv.conf names only the local dnsmasq, so probing its entries alone cannot say whether the pinned upstream was still alive when that dnsmasq went silent. Anything unreadable or keyless yields []."
msgstr "Adhabu ya dhambi resolv.conf Majina tu ya dnsmasq ya ndani, kwa hivyo kuchunguza maingilio yake peke yake hawezi kusema kama upstream pinned ilikuwa bado hai wakati dnsmasq kwamba akaenda kimya. Chochote kisicho na thamani au kisicho na thamani []..."

