msgid "A change to the `administrator` role group reaches `config.admin_email` only on the next deploy, and a changed directory name or email never reaches an existing account, because the list is rendered into `FRIENDICA_ADMIN_MAIL` at deploy time and `ldapauth` reads the directory only when it creates the account; options: the `saml` addon migration above with an attribute and group map, or a cron that refreshes the account and the list from LDAP."
