msgid "A human of the longest form still gets a Bluesky handle with the `kc-` prefix. Superseded by the handle rules of the `web-app-bluesky` login broker (`files/login-broker/`): a short username keeps its name as the handle, a reserved one gets the `i8-` prefix, a username over 18 characters picks its handle in a form, and a legacy `kc-` account is reported."
