# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A remote source (``[user@]host:/path``) is returned as-is with the default target (its colon is the rsync host separator). Otherwise a colon suffix is a restore target only when absolute; a relative suffix is rejected here (device parses those itself)."
msgstr "Chanzo cha mbali (``[user@]host:/path``) Inarudi kama lengo la default (Mwenyeji wake ni Rsync host separator)Vinginevyo, kipaza sauti cha koloni ni lengo la kurejesha tu wakati kamili; kipaza sauti cha jamaa kinakataliwa hapa. (Mgawanyiko huu unawahusu wale wenyewe)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A rendered ``socialhome.toml`` is mounted alongside the environment file. It carries exactly one setting — ``[standalone].external_url`` — because that value has no ``SH_*`` environment equivalent upstream and federation pairing returns ``422 NOT_CONFIGURED`` without it."
msgstr "Kuwa tayari ``socialhome.toml`` Imewekwa pamoja na faili ya mazingira. Kwa upande mwingine, kuna njia moja tu - ``[standalone].external_url`` kwa kuwa thamani hiyo haikuwa ``SH_*`` mazingira sawa na upstream na shirikisho pairing kurudi ``422 NOT_CONFIGURED`` bila ya hivyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A rendered `socialhome.toml` is mounted alongside the environment file. It carries exactly one setting — `[standalone].external_url` — because that value has no `SH_*` environment equivalent upstream and federation pairing returns `422 NOT_CONFIGURED` without it."
msgstr "Kuwa tayari `socialhome.toml` Imewekwa pamoja na faili ya mazingira. Kwa upande mwingine, kuna njia moja tu - `[standalone].external_url` kwa kuwa thamani hiyo haikuwa `SH_*` mazingira sawa na upstream na shirikisho pairing kurudi `422 NOT_CONFIGURED` bila ya hivyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A repository definition must declare at least one of these; the rest (``name``, ``description``, ``gpgkey``, ``gpgcheck``, ``state``) qualify it."
msgstr "Ufafanuzi wa kuhifadhi lazima ueleze angalau moja ya haya; wengine (``name``, Kwa hivyo, ``description``, Kwa hivyo, ``gpgkey``, Kwa hivyo, ``gpgcheck``, Kwa hivyo, ``state``) ya kuhitimu."

# mstari wa mbele, kwa hivyo mteja anaendelea kushughulikia URL yake halisi ya
# upstream. `listen: [80]` Inatumikia juu ya HTTP wazi na haina cheti;
# `paths:` Ramani kadhaa hazina chini ya mwenyeji mmoja; `mirror:` na majina
# ya wagombea wa nafasi za juu katika `502`, Kwa hivyo, `503` au au au au
# `504`; `passthrough: true` suti upstream kwamba mikono nje URL tayari kubeba
# prefix repository.
msgid "A repository is proxied by Nexus. A host is additionally answered for by the frontend, so a client keeps addressing its real upstream URL. `listen: [80]` serves it over plain HTTP and issues no certificate; `paths:` maps several repositories under one host; `mirror:` on a repository names the sibling the frontend retries against on `502`, `503` or `504`; `passthrough: true` suits an upstream that hands out URLs already carrying the repository prefix."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A repository may serve several hosts and a host may be served by one repository only; a repository without a host is proxied but never hijacked, which is how a client that already addresses Nexus directly is served."
msgstr "Hifadhi inaweza kutumikia majeshi kadhaa na mwenyeji anaweza kuhudumiwa na hifadhi moja tu; hifadhi bila mwenyeji ni proxied lakini kamwe hijacked, ambayo ni jinsi mteja ambaye tayari anashughulikia Nexus moja kwa moja anahudumiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A repository-local Sphinx entry point is also available at [Contribution Guide Index](docs/contributing/index.rst)."
msgstr "Sehemu ya kuingia ya Sphinx ya ndani pia inapatikana [Mwongozo wa Index](docs/contributing/index.rst)..."

