msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An entry the server already answered with a damaged span is skipped. The answer is deterministic for an unchanged source, so asking again spends a masking pass, a request and an inference to arrive at the same refusal. The mark rides in the entry's comments, so gettext drops it the moment the source changes and the entry is offered again by itself."
msgstr "Kuingia server tayari alijibu na span kuharibiwa ni amekosa. Jibu ni la kuamua kwa chanzo kisichobadilika, kwa hivyo kuuliza tena hutumia kupitisha masking, ombi na tofauti kufikia kukataa sawa. Alama inapanda katika maoni ya kuingia, kwa hivyo gettext inaacha wakati chanzo kinabadilika na kuingia hutolewa tena yenyewe."

