# Spika, kwa hiyo, naomba `🛡️ Trusted` the the the the the the the the the the
# the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the
# the the the the `pull_request_target` Kujenga switches kwa kichwa PR na
# `pull_request` Muongozaji anaruka kusubiri - hakuna kushinikiza zaidi
# inahitajika. (Re-running kukimbia zilizopo haina kuchukua studio mpya, kwa
# sababu GitHub replays awali tukio payload.) Tofauti ya biashara ni kwamba
# mabadiliko yoyote ya lebo huanza kuendesha PR mpya.
msgid "Both events carry a `labeled` trigger, so applying the `🛡️ Trusted` label starts fresh runs that already observe it: the `pull_request_target` build switches to the PR head and the `pull_request` orchestrator skips the wait — no extra push is needed. (Re-running an existing run does not pick up a new label, because GitHub replays the original event payload.) The trade-off is that any label change starts a fresh PR CI run."
msgstr ""

