# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both paths elevate privileges via `sudo` when not run as root, and the script verifies `bwrap` and `socat` on `PATH` before it exits. macOS uses `sandbox-exec` from the base system and does not need this target."
msgstr "Njia zote mbili zinaongeza upendeleo kupitia `sudo` Kama huna cha kuandika basi kachukue kopo ukachambe. `bwrap` Aidha, na `socat` Juu ya `PATH` kabla ya kuondoka. Matumizi ya MacOS `sandbox-exec` Mfumo wa msingi na hauhitajiki."

# hauaminiki, kwa hivyo mpaka wa kiwango cha kernel unahitajika juu ya sanduku
# lao la mchanga wa programu. [wa wa wa wa wa](https://gvisor.dev/) Inatoa
# mipaka nyuma ya muda wa OCI, hivyo kila programu ya wakala inakaa
# specifikationer ya kawaida ya chombo na pini tu `runtime: runsc`, kutumia
# bomba la picha zilizopo, replicas, ukaguzi wa afya, na mashine mbili zamode.
# [Vyombo vya Kata](https://katacontainers.io/) Kufungia Firecracker ilikuwa
# chaguo la awali; Uamuzi #2 Inaelezea kwa nini haifai kwenye injini hii ya
# chombo. ([ya ya ya2b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b
# b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b
# b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b b
# b](https://github.com/e2b-dev/infra) Ni mbadala ya kiwango cha juu lakini
# huleta mpangilio wake wa Nomad /Consul na x86-cloud self-host, ambayo
# inaweza kuchukua nafasi ya mfano wa kundi.)
msgid "Both platforms run model-generated code, which is untrusted, so a kernel-level boundary is required on top of their in-app sandboxing. [gVisor](https://gvisor.dev/) provides that boundary behind an OCI runtime, so each agent app stays a normal container spec and only pins `runtime: runsc`, reusing the existing image pipeline, replicas, healthchecks, and dual-mode machinery. [Kata Containers](https://katacontainers.io/) wrapping Firecracker was the original choice; Decision #2 records why it is unreachable on this container engine. ([E2B](https://github.com/e2b-dev/infra) is the higher-level alternative but brings its own Nomad/Consul orchestration and x86-cloud self-host, which would replace the swarm model.)"
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both pools feed the assignment, so narrowing `distros` to one value pins every row to it rather than reducing the run."
msgstr "Pande zote mbili zinakula chakula, hivyo kupunguza `distros` Kwa thamani moja pins kila mstari kwa hiyo badala ya kupunguza kukimbia."

# za Jinja haziwezi kutatuliwa kwa hivyo configs zilizozalishwa hazivumiliki
# kimya kimya kimya.
msgid "Both renderers fail loudly when Jinja markers cannot be resolved so generated configs never silently leak unrendered placeholders."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both requirement files name the same collections at the same versions: the Galaxy file is the normal source, the git file the fallback used when galaxy.ansible.com is unreachable. A bump that touches only one of them would make the fallback install something the pin does not describe, so an update is applied to both or to neither."
msgstr "Faili zote mbili zinahitaji jina makusanyo sawa katika matoleo sawa: faili Galaxy ni chanzo cha kawaida, faili git kuanguka kutumika wakati. galaxy.ansible.com Ni kitu ambacho hakiwezekani. bump kwamba kugusa mmoja wao tu bila kufanya kuanguka kufunga kitu pin haina kuelezea, hivyo update ni kutumika kwa wote au si."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both run from the trusted workflow ref and check out the version tag for the actual build payload, so the release artefacts match the tagged commit byte-for-byte."
msgstr "Wote hukimbia kutoka kwa kazi ya kuaminika ref na angalia lebo ya toleo kwa malipo halisi ya kujenga, kwa hivyo sanaa za kutolewa zinalingana na ahadi iliyowekwa nate-kwa-byte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both sections are merged per entry, so an inventory that names one field keeps the rest of the declaration, and a key nobody declared is added."
msgstr "Sehemu zote mbili zimeunganishwa kwa kuingia, kwa hivyo hesabu kwamba majina ya uwanja mmoja huweka tangazo lote, na muhimu hakuna mtu aliyetangazwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both sides pass `primary_apps` (not the round closure) as the BFS seed and the variant-merged services map for that round, so the reachability walk sees the same topology the inventory baked."
msgstr "Pande zote mbili zinapita `primary_apps` (Sio ya kufungwa kwa mzunguko) Kama mbegu ya BFS na ramani ya huduma za aina tofauti kwa pande zote, hivyo kutembea kwa ufanisi unaona topolojia sawa ya hesabu iliyooka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both sources carry the same pinned collections, so the only thing separating them is how long they take and whether they answer at all. A single slow day says nothing: galaxy.ansible.com degrades and recovers, and a git clone can stall on one runner. The default is therefore retuned only when a rolling window of daily samples shows one source durably behind the other."
msgstr "Vyanzo vyote viwili hubeba makusanyo sawa, kwa hivyo kitu pekee kinachotenganisha ni muda gani huchukua na ikiwa hujibu kabisa. Siku moja ya mapumziko ya siku ya mapumziko haina maana: galaxy.ansible.com Degrades na kupona, na clone ya git inaweza kusimama kwenye mchezaji mmoja. default ni hivyo retuned tu wakati dirisha rolling ya sampuli za kila siku inaonyesha chanzo kimoja kwa muda mrefu nyuma ya nyingine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "Both targets (Debian changelog and the RPM ``%changelog`` section) are fully regenerated on every run from the kept entries plus an archived-releases notice that points at the documentation site and lists the archived versions and dates as plain text. The notice is folded into the body of the oldest kept entry (not appended after the last entry), because free text after the final entry is not valid changelog data and makes the native parsers warn. Because the package files are regenerated, they cannot drift from the CHANGELOG.md SPOT."
msgstr "Malengo yote mawili (Mabadiliko ya Debian na RPM ``%changelog`` Sehemu ya) ni kikamilifu upya juu ya kila kukimbia kutoka entries naendelea pamoja na taarifa archived-releases kwamba pointi katika tovuti nyaraka na orodha ya matoleo archived na tarehe kama maandishi wazi. Taarifa hiyo imejumuishwa katika mwili wa kuingia kwa zamani zaidi (Haikubaliki baada ya kuingia kwa mwisho)Kwa sababu maandishi ya bure baada ya kuingia kwa mwisho sio data halali ya mabadiliko na hufanya parsers ya asili kuonya. Kwa sababu faili za mfuko zinazalishwa tena, haziwezi kuondokana na CHANGELOG.md ya Spoti."

