# the the the the the the the the - the the the the the the the the the the
# the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the
# the the the the the the the the the the the the the `pull_request_target`
# Kufanya ukaguzi wa **Kuunganisha ref** (`refs/pull/<N>/merge`) kutoka kwa
# uhifadhi wa msingi: mabadiliko ya PR yalijiunga kwenye msingi, na maandishi
# yote ya kazi na ya kujenga-orchestration yanatoka msingi, kamwe kutoka kwa
# ngome. Kwa sababu kwa `actions/checkout` Kwa upande mwingine, kukataa
# kununua PR ref `pull_request_target`Vyanzo vya Checkout
# `allow-unsafe-pr-checkout: true`. Ujenzi wa barabara zisizojengwa **Hakuna
# siri za shirika** – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – –
# – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – –
# – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – – –
# `secrets: inherit` Haikubaliki na inathibitishwa kwa GHCR na kazi ya kila
# siku. `GITHUB_TOKEN` Kwa hiyo, tu, fork yenye nia mbaya haiwezi kusoma siri
# za kuhifadhi / kuunda. (Kwa kuwa `pull_request_target` Bado tuna safari
# ndefu `packages: write`, Kwa hiyo, kwa `🛡️ Trusted` Lebo inabaki mipaka
# halisi ya uaminifu kwa chochote zaidi ya uchapishaji wa picha.)
msgid "By default — for an **untrusted** fork PR — the privileged `pull_request_target` build checks out the **base merge ref** (`refs/pull/<N>/merge`) from the base repository: the PR's changes merged onto base, with all workflow and build-orchestration scripts coming from base, never from the fork. Because `actions/checkout` otherwise refuses to fetch a PR ref under `pull_request_target`, the source checkout sets `allow-unsafe-pr-checkout: true`. The untrusted build runs **without organization secrets** — `secrets: inherit` is not passed and it authenticates to GHCR with the per-job `GITHUB_TOKEN` only, so a malicious fork cannot read repository/organization secrets. (The `pull_request_target` token still carries `packages: write`, so the `🛡️ Trusted` label remains the real trust boundary for anything beyond image publication.)"
msgstr ""

