# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cache directory used by the [pre-commit](https://pre-commit.com/) framework. Granted because pre-commit hooks run on every commit and need to populate and read this cache; without it, every commit attempt would fail with `Read-only file system`. The cache contains only hook tool installations, no project data."
msgstr "Mwongozo wa Cache uliotumiwa na [Kabla ya uteuzi](https://pre-commit.com/) mfumo wa. Imetolewa kwa sababu ndoano za kabla ya kukimbia kila kujitolea na haja ya kuondokana na kusoma cache hii; bila hiyo, kila jaribio la kujitolea litashindwa na `Read-only file system`. cache ina tu hook chombo mitambo, hakuna data ya mradi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cache freshness window in minutes, applied to every Nexus proxy repo (`contentMaxAge`/`metadataMaxAge`/negative-cache TTL). Stays strictly below the 7-day `Valid-Until` window Debian / Ubuntu generate in their apt `Release` files, so `apt-get update` never aborts with \"Release file ... is expired\"."
msgstr "Cache freshness dirisha katika dakika, kutumika kwa kila wakala Nexus repo (`contentMaxAge`Kwa hivyo`metadataMaxAge`- - - - - -). Endelea kwa kasi chini ya 7Siku ya `Valid-Until` Windows Debian / Ubuntu inazalisha kwenye apt yao `Release` nyaraka, hivyo `apt-get update` Kamwe kutoa mimba \"Faili ya faili ... imefutwa\"..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cache key: `(str(Path(path).resolve()), st_mtime_ns, st_size)`. Symlinks resolve once at the cache boundary so the same target shares an entry regardless of how callers spell the path. The mtime+size signature invalidates entries whenever the file is rewritten by an external process (e.g. Ansible's `copy:` module persisting tokens while the same Python process keeps running across many calls)."
msgstr "Kikoa cha msingi: `(str(Path(path).resolve()), st_mtime_ns, st_size)`. Symlinks hutatua mara moja kwenye mpaka wa cache hivyo lengo moja linashiriki kuingia bila kujali jinsi wapiga simu wanavyoelezea njia. Mtime + ukubwa saini invalidates entries kila wakati faili ni rewritten na mchakato wa nje (Mfano wa Ansible `copy:` moduli inaendelea ishara wakati mchakato huo wa Python unaendelea kukimbia katika simu nyingi)..."

