# kuingia `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Jukumu hilo linaendelea
# `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (Kwa hiyo mkataba wa ajira bado
# unaridhisha) Lakini lakini lakini `roles_with_service('matomo')` Kuondoa
# kutoka kwa `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` na kwa milo tracker2Mkataba wa.
# Hifadhi ya Faili ya static (Mfumo wa autoindex) Aidha, na 301vhosts ya moja
# kwa moja ambayo haina ukurasa wa mtumiaji wa HTML wenye thamani `_paq` Kuwa
# tracker. Kamati hiyo iliambatana na `track:` Bendera ya Volta ya Juu.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr ""

# Chagua kuingia `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Jukumu hilo linaendelea
# `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (Kwa hiyo mkataba wa ajira bado
# unaridhisha) Lakini lakini lakini `roles_with_service('prometheus')` Kuondoa
# kutoka kwa `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Kwa ajili ya kuhifadhiwa
# 301Vhosts ya moja kwa moja tu ambayo kamwe haitoi ombi kupitia
# lua-resty-prometheus, kwa hivyo haitoi `app="<role>"` Kuwa na malengo na sio
# kuwa na malengo. Kamati hiyo iliambatana na `scrape:` Bendera ya Volta ya
# Juu.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Nyaraka za `unsafe-*: true` Bendera ya `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. Inapaswa kuunganishwa na A `Reason:` Katika mstari huo huo kutaja nini mapumziko bila kupumzika. `unsafe-inline` Kusimamia utekelezaji wa inline mahitaji ya XSS na `unsafe-eval` Re-admits kamba-to-code, hivyo bendera lazima kuthibitishwa dhidi ya programu kuendesha, si kunakiliwa kutoka jukumu lingine."

