# wao ana wajibu wa kuandika kitabu chake. Kuwa tupu ``access_grants`` Sio
# "hakuna mwili": Open WebUI inasoma kama kila msimamizi, ambayo ni pana
# kuliko ``mcp`` Kikundi cha. Tangu wakati huo tangu
# ``ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`` Hufanya env mamlaka tena juu ya kila
# mwanzo, kuingia kwa kuwezeshwa lakini bila kibali kunaweza kuwezesha
# upatikanaji wa watendaji wote kabla ya utoaji wa kwanza kukimbia na baada ya
# chombo chochote kuanza upya. Kuingia kwa walemavu hakutumiki kabisa, kwa
# hivyo kurudi sio upatikanaji badala ya mengi.
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Entries render **disabled**, and the task enables each one in the same write that carries its grant. An empty ``access_grants`` is not “nobody”: Open WebUI reads it as every administrator, which is wider than the ``mcp`` group. Since ``ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`` makes the env authoritative again on every start, an enabled-but-ungranted entry would hand access to all administrators before the first provisioning run and after any bare container restart. A disabled entry is not served at all, so the fallback is no access rather than too much."
msgstr "Entries ya Kuingia **Watu wenye ulemavu**Kila mmoja wao ana wajibu wa kuandika kitabu chake. Kuwa tupu ``access_grants`` Sio \"hakuna mwili\": Open WebUI inasoma kama kila msimamizi, ambayo ni pana kuliko ``mcp`` Kikundi cha. Tangu wakati huo tangu ``ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false`` Hufanya env mamlaka tena juu ya kila mwanzo, kuingia kwa kuwezeshwa lakini bila kibali kunaweza kuwezesha upatikanaji wa watendaji wote kabla ya utoaji wa kwanza kukimbia na baada ya chombo chochote kuanza upya. Kuingia kwa walemavu hakutumiki kabisa, kwa hivyo kurudi sio upatikanaji badala ya mengi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Entries render **disabled**, and the task enables each one in the same write that carries its grant. An empty `access_grants` is not \"nobody\": Open WebUI reads it as every administrator, which is wider than the `mcp` group. Since `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false` makes the env authoritative again on every start, an enabled-but-ungranted entry would hand access to all administrators before the first provisioning run and after any bare container restart. A disabled entry is not served at all, so the fallback is no access rather than too much."
msgstr "Entries ya Kuingia **Watu wenye ulemavu**Kila mmoja wao ana wajibu wa kuandika kitabu chake. Kuwa tupu `access_grants` kuwa si \"nobody\": Open WebUI inasoma kama kila msimamizi, ambayo ni pana kuliko `mcp` Kikundi cha. Tangu wakati huo tangu `ENABLE_PERSISTENT_CONFIG=false` Hufanya env mamlaka tena juu ya kila mwanzo, kuingia kwa kuwezeshwa lakini bila kibali kunaweza kuwezesha upatikanaji wa watendaji wote kabla ya utoaji wa kwanza kukimbia na baada ya chombo chochote kuanza upya. Kuingia kwa walemavu hakutumiki kabisa, kwa hivyo kurudi sio upatikanaji badala ya mengi."

