# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "GitHub cancels a job that has sat queued for 24 hours. That clock starts when the job is queued, not when the run starts, and a `needs:` edge delays queueing until the dependency completes. A run that queues its whole matrix at once leaves the tail waiting past the cut, where it dies unrun. Deploying in chunks chained on `needs:` restarts the clock per chunk."
msgstr "GitHub inafuta kazi ambayo imewekwa 24 masaa. Saa hiyo huanza wakati kazi iko foleni, sio wakati wa kukimbia, na `needs:` Kuchelewesha foleni mpaka utegemezi umekamilika. kukimbia kwamba foleni tumbo yake nzima mara moja majani mkia kusubiri nyuma ya kukata, ambapo ni kufa unrun. Kuingiza katika chunks minyororo juu ya `needs:` Inaanza saa kwa chunk."

# wa wa-8 Kwa hisani ya RaiaMwema (kwa kutumia njia mbili, zote mbili 512) na
# kuikamilisha kwa ukamilifu. ``...``. template ya jina la mtumiaji
# ``priority`` ya pili na ya mwisho ``whitelist`` Mwisho, na juu ya
# ``--failed`` njia Whitelist ni tupu, hivyo kata daima ardhi ndani ya orodha
# ya kipaumbele: kipimo 21 Kwa upande wa 69 Licha ya kuwepo kwa hali hiyo,
# 21ya nusu saa. CJK atangaza gharama za usajili 3 Mheshimiwa Spika, kwa hiyo,
# bajeti22 Kuonyesha majina dhidi ya28 Maelezo ya mchezo ILS. Kila kazi ya
# *kuitwa* Kazi ya kazi inafungua logi yake kwa ``##[group] Inputs`` kuzuia
# kushikilia maadili kamili, hivyo kwamba ni SPOT kwa chochote kichwa hawezi
# kushikilia.
msgid "GitHub cuts ``display_title`` at 512 UTF-8 bytes (measured on two runs, both exactly 512) and closes it with a literal ``...``. The run-name template renders ``priority`` second-to-last and ``whitelist`` last, and on the ``--failed`` path the whitelist is empty, so the cut always lands inside the priority list: measured 21 of 69 roles survived, the 21st a half-token. A CJK display name costs 3 bytes per character, so the budget is ~22 display names against ~28 bare role ids. Every job of the *called* workflow opens its log with an ``##[group] Inputs`` block holding the full values, so that is the SPOT for anything the title cannot hold."
msgstr ""

