# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the prometheus integration: every web-app/svc role declares the shared `prometheus` service entry, the prometheus role's own nginx + docker-health wiring is intact, and the native-metrics scrape contract (`services.prometheus.native_metrics.enabled` ⇔ `templates/prometheus.yml.j2`) holds across the roles tree."
msgstr "Vipimo vya ushirikiano vinavyotekeleza invariants ya ushirikiano wa prometheus: kila jukumu la mtandao wa programu / svc linatangaza ushirikiano `prometheus` Kuingia kwa huduma, jukumu la prometheus mwenyewe nginx + docker-health wiring ni intact, na asili-metrics kupiga mkataba (`services.prometheus.native_metrics.enabled` Kwa hivyo `templates/prometheus.yml.j2`) Kushikilia juu ya mti wa majukumu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce invariants of the role dependency graph expressed via `meta/main.yml`: declared `dependencies:` targets MUST exist, the `dependencies:` graph MUST be acyclic, and meta dependencies MUST NOT be declared when a guarded `include_role` / `import_role` would suffice."
msgstr "Majaribio ya ushirikiano ambayo yanatekeleza invariants ya graph ya wajibu iliyoonyeshwa kupitia `meta/main.yml`· Kutangazwa `dependencies:` Malengo lazima yawepo, na `dependencies:` Grafu lazima iwe acyclic, na utegemezi wa meta haipaswi kutangazwa wakati wa ulinzi `include_role` Kwa hivyo `import_role` itakuwa ya kutosha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce per-role invariants of the unified ``services.sso`` block across roles, including normalization of ``allowed_groups`` paths and allocation of per-consumer SSO-proxy ports."
msgstr "Majaribio ya Ushirikiano ambayo yanatekeleza invariants ya kila moja ya umoja ``services.sso`` kuzuia majukumu yote, ikiwa ni pamoja na kuimarisha ``allowed_groups`` Njia na ugawaji wa bandari za SSO-proxy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce role naming conventions: folder names match the declared category prefix (`web-app-*`, `web-svc-*`, `sys-*`, …), and roles do not collide on canonical identifiers."
msgstr "Majaribio ya ushirikiano ambayo yanatekeleza mikataba ya jina la jukumu: majina ya folda yanalingana na kikundi kilichotangazwa cha prefix (`web-app-*`, Kwa hivyo, `web-svc-*`, Kwa hivyo, `sys-*`...), na majukumu si kugonga kwenye vitambulisho canonical."

# majukumu ambayo yanawakilisha maombi yanayotumika: `web-app-*` Ndege lazima
# iwe na `README.md` (Mahitaji ya App ya Mtandao Dashboard), Kila moja ya
# majina hayo ni kinyume na `group_names` katika vitabu vya kucheza/roles
# LAZIMA kuamua kwa kweli `application_id`, Kila mmoja `applications['…']` Kwa
# hivyo `applications.get('…')` Kwa hivyo `applications.name` Kwa hivyo
# `get_domain('…')` Kumbuka LAZIMA kutaja maombi yaliyopo, na majukumu
# haipaswi kufikia `applications[...]` kwa ajili ya matumizi; lazima
# `lookup('applications', …)` au au au au
# `utils.roles.applications.config.get` Badala yake.
msgid "Integration tests that enforce rules about roles which represent deployable applications: `web-app-*` roles MUST ship a `README.md` (required for the Web App Dashboard), every literal name compared against `group_names` in playbooks/roles MUST resolve to a real `application_id`, every `applications['…']` / `applications.get('…')` / `applications.name` / `get_domain('…')` reference MUST name an existing application, and roles MUST NOT reach into `applications[...]` by subscript; they MUST use `lookup('applications', …)` or `utils.roles.applications.config.get` instead."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce safe handling of secrets across roles: env-file values MUST be quoted, shell tasks MUST quote password expansions, and password *definitions* MUST NOT apply the `quote` filter (which corrupts the stored value)."
msgstr "Vipimo vya ushirikiano vinavyotekeleza utunzaji salama wa siri katika majukumu: maadili ya faili ya env LA LA LAZIMA kunukuliwa, kazi za shell LAZIMA zinukuu upanuzi wa nenosiri, na nenosiri *Ufafanuzi wa* haipaswi kutumika kwa ajili ya `quote` filter ya filter (ambayo inapoteza thamani iliyohifadhiwa)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce structural invariants of every role under `roles/`: folder-name conventions and `include_tasks` / `import_tasks` target existence."
msgstr "Uainishaji wa vipengele ambavyo vinatekeleza majukumu ya kila ngazi ya `roles/`· Orodha ya majina na `include_tasks` Kwa hivyo `import_tasks` Malengo ya kuwepo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that enforce the contract between `group_vars/all/08_networks.yml` and the roles that require a container network: subnets MUST be valid, unique, and non-overlapping, network names MUST map to an `application_id`, and every role that ships a `compose.yml.j2` with an `application_id` MUST have a network entry under `defaults_networks.local`."
msgstr "Uchunguzi wa kina ambao unakiuka mkataba kati ya `group_vars/all/08_networks.yml` na majukumu ambayo yanahitaji mtandao wa chombo: subnets lazima iwe halali, ya kipekee, na isiyo ya juu, majina ya mtandao lazima ramani `application_id`, Na kwa kila hatua inayochukuliwa na `compose.yml.j2` Kwa kuwa `application_id` Lazima kuwa na kuingia kwa mtandao chini ya `defaults_networks.local`..."

