msgid "On Multisite, [03_multisite.yml](../../tasks/03_multisite.yml) also copies the same file to `wp-content/sunrise.php` and sets `SUNRISE`. WordPress looks the site up by `Host` before any mu-plugin runs, so a sibling host would match no site and get redirected to the clearnet `wp-signup.php`. Loaded as the drop-in, the file answers `pre_get_site_by_path` for a sibling host with the site of its canonical host. It also sets `COOKIE_DOMAIN` for every site host: the network domain's sibling in the request's network for a host at or below it, and a host-only cookie for a child on its own domain (such as `biberblog.<primary>`), because a browser drops a cookie whose domain the host does not match. A constant guard keeps the second load from mu-plugins from registering anything twice."
msgstr ""

