# wasaidizi wa YAML waliohifadhiwa na hutoa ``PlanEntry`` madhara; hakuna
# madhara ya mfumo wa faili. Utaratibu wa kuweka kila pande zote utaamuliwa na
# ``CombinedResolver`` (kuona kuona kuona ``.legacy_resolver``): Kila jukumu
# linachangia watoaji wake wa kujitoa na ni pamoja na umoja. Kwa hivyo ufunguo
# wa huduma huvunjwa haraka kama jukumu lolote katika kufungwa kwa ufahamu wa
# pande zote anasema inapaswa kuwa (Moja kwa moja ``True`` au kuwa ``"{{
# '<role>' in group_names }}"`` ya Muungano, ambayo yote mawili yamekubaliwa
# na ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``)Ikiwa
# kila sehemu ina alama yake ``False`` Hii ni pamoja na nje ya sehemu.
msgid "Pure function — reads role metadata via cached YAML helpers and emits ``PlanEntry`` tuples; no filesystem side effects. The include set per round is resolved by the ``CombinedResolver`` (see ``.legacy_resolver``): each role contributes its own pulled-in providers and the include is the union. A service-key is therefore pulled in as soon as ANY role in the round-aware closure says it should be (literal ``True`` OR the ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja form, both accepted by ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``); if EVERY role marks it ``False`` it stays out of the include."
msgstr ""

