msgid "Shared request limit: `templates/config.yml.j2` includes `templates/web.ratelimited.template.yml`, whose nginx `limit_req` keys on `$binary_remote_addr`, and behind the front proxy every client arrives from the proxy's address. A gallery run of one administrator (about 25 page loads per minute) drew 586 responses with status 429 within four minutes, so one busy client throttles the whole forum. Options: set `real_ip_header X-Forwarded-For` with `set_real_ip_from` for the proxy network in a launcher `run:` step, or raise `reqs_per_second`/`reqs_per_minute` in `params`. Both change the bootstrap digest and rebuild the image."
