msgstr "Uchunguzi katika saraka hii lazima tu kufunika sheria za muundo `compose.yml.j2` na vifaa vya kufundishia. Majaribio ya matoleo ya picha, salama, au semantics ya huduma lazima iishi mahali pengine chini ya `tests/integration/`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover target-existence rules for `include_*` / `import_*` directives. Rules about the block-level `when:` wrapping those includes MUST live under [`../when/`](../when/); rules about `run_once_<role>` flag inclusion MUST live under [`../run_once/`](../run_once/)."
msgstr "Majaribio katika saraka hii lazima tu kufunika sheria za kuwepo kwa lengo `include_*` Kwa hivyo `import_*` maagizo. Sheria juu ya kiwango cha block `when:` Miongoni mwa mambo hayo ni pamoja na kuishi chini ya [`../when/`](../when/); Sheria kuhusu `run_once_<role>` Bendera ya Volta ya Juu [`../run_once/`](../run_once/)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the `server.*` sub-tree of `meta/services.yml`. Other top-level invariants live in the sibling [`services/`](../services/) cluster."
msgstr "Uchunguzi katika orodha hii lazima tu kufunika `server.*` Sehemu ya chini `meta/services.yml`. Waathirika wengine wa hali ya juu wanaishi katika eneo la Sibling [`services/`](../services/) makundi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the category hierarchy itself. Tests for `application_id` classification driven by `invokable_paths.py` MUST live under `tests/integration/roles/applications/id/`."
msgstr "Majaribio katika saraka hii lazima tu kufunika hierarchy ya jamii yenyewe. Majaribio kwa ajili ya `application_id` Uainishaji unaofanywa na `invokable_paths.py` Lazima kuishi chini ya `tests/integration/roles/applications/id/`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the dashboard-scope contract. Playwright env-template / spec parity tests MUST live under [`playwright/`](../playwright/)."
msgstr "Majaribio katika saraka hii lazima tu kufunika mkataba wa dashibodi. Playwright envlate / spec usawa vipimo lazima kuishi chini [`playwright/`](../playwright/)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the four classifications of a single project-wide match stream: literal-app calls (`test_literal_paths.py`), variable-app calls with an existing literal path (`test_variable_paths.py`), `~`-concatenated path expressions (`test_wildcard_paths.py`), and the strict per-role pass for `lookup('config', application_id, …)` calls inside `roles/<role>/...` (`test_role_local_paths.py`). Pure unit coverage of the lookup plugin's return values MUST live under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."
msgstr "Mtihani katika saraka hii LAZIMA tu kufunika maagizo manne ya mkondo mmoja wa mechi ya mradi: wito halisi wa programu (`test_literal_paths.py`), variable-programu wito kwa njia ya moja kwa moja (`test_variable_paths.py`)Kwa hivyo, `~`Maelezo ya njia (`test_wildcard_paths.py`)na kwa milomo ya wajeni, `lookup('config', application_id, …)` Wito wa ndani `roles/<role>/...` (`test_role_local_paths.py`)Ufikiaji kamili wa kitengo cha thamani ya kurudi kwa Plugin lazima iwe chini `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover the pure-function behaviour of `utils.cert_utils` and `utils.tls_common`. Lookup-plugin integration that depends on these modules MUST live under `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`."
msgstr "Majaribio katika saraka hii lazima tu kufunika tabia ya kazi safi `utils.cert_utils` Aidha, na `utils.tls_common`. Kuangalia-plugin ushirikiano kwamba inategemea modules hizi lazima kuishi chini `tests/unit/python/plugins/lookup/`..."

