msgid "Tests in this directory MUST only cover variable definition / consumption checks. Four orthogonal scopes live here:"
msgstr "Majaribio katika saraka hii lazima tu kufunika ufafanuzi wa kutofautiana / ukaguzi wa matumizi. Kuna aina nne za orchids hapa:"

