# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests that MUST adjust `sys.path` or load fixtures before importing the module under test."
msgstr "Uchunguzi ambao unapaswa kurekebisha `sys.path` au kusitisha mimba, ndivyo wanavyo jipongeza na kuzawadiwa na wale waliowatuma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tests that enforce the `test_*.py` prefix convention and the rule that every `test_*.py` file lives under `tests/` and contains at least one runnable `unittest.TestCase`."
msgstr "Majaribio ambayo yanasisitiza `test_*.py` Katiba ya Jamhuri ya Muungano na Kanuni ambayo kila `test_*.py` Maisha ya chini `tests/` Kuwa na angalau moja ya viungo `unittest.TestCase`..."

