msgid "Tests that statically analyze Ansible config or task YAML files without exercising runtime boundaries MUST live under `tests/lint/ansible/` instead."
msgstr "Majaribio ambayo tulichambua usanidi wa Ansible au faili za YAML bila kutumia mipaka ya muda wa kukimbia lazima kuishi chini ya `tests/lint/ansible/` Badala yake."

