msgid "The mesh state is replayed the same way, and as the boolean the title carried rather than only when it is true. These tokens feed the priority line, where an unpinned mesh axis offers both states: a failed direct swarm row came back as itself *and* as a meshed sibling, spending two jobs to reproduce one. The pin halves that to the arm that actually failed. Only a mode the mesh axis covers takes it, so a compose token stays as short as it was."
