msgid "The meshes are inventory values, and every role ships them empty. ``networks.meshes`` of this role declares them in the hub’s ``host_vars``, or in the ``host_vars`` of every member when there is no hub, and ``networks.meshes`` of every other role lists the meshes its hosts join. A host that carries no other role on the mesh joins by listing the mesh name in this role’s own ``networks.meshes``; a mapping there declares a mesh, a name joins one. The development lab declares two, ``swarm`` and ``data``, in `wireguard.yml <../../inventories/development/wireguard.yml>`__; `wireguard-three-meshes <../../inventories/examples/wireguard-three-meshes/README.md>`__ declares three. Consumers read a host’s mesh address through ``lookup('mesh_address', <host>)`` instead of naming a mesh."
