# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The producer [build_ldap_role_entries](../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/filter_plugins/build_ldap_role_entries.py) also emits a per-application `groupOfNames` container `cn=<application_id>,ou=roles,...` whose `member` attribute references every role group of that application, so an LDAP-only consumer can still navigate the hierarchy. Keycloak does not rely on those containers; it reconstructs `/roles/<application_id>/<role_name>` via per-application mappers (see below)."
msgstr "Mtayarishaji wa [build_ldap_role_entries](../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/filter_plugins/build_ldap_role_entries.py) Aidha, matumizi ya `groupOfNames` Chombo cha kuhifadhi `cn=<application_id>,ou=roles,...` Ambaye ni nani ambaye `member` Inataja kila kikundi cha jukumu la programu hiyo, kwa hivyo watumiaji wa LDAP pekee wanaweza kuendelea na uongozi. Keycloak haitegemei vyombo hivyo; inajenga upya `/roles/<application_id>/<role_name>` Kwa kutumia mappers (Tazama hapa chini)..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The production-safe path MUST follow Mattermost's documented Agents and MCP deployment guidance."
msgstr "Njia salama ya uzalishaji ni lazima MattermostViongozi wa CCM na viongozi wa CCM."

msgid "The profile specs red on the onion pass of `/tmp/compose-deploy-iam-20.log` carry spec fixes that never ran: `test-profile-sync.js` builds a website under the 100 characters WordPress allows (`user_url_too_long` rejected the whole sync), `test-profile-lock.js` expects the 501 `application_passwords_disabled` refusal on a non-https base (core issues application passwords only with `is_ssl()`), and reads the form URL through `getAttribute(\"action\")` because the hidden `action` input of `user-edit.php` shadows `form.action`. Open: rerun both specs on an onion and a clearnet pass; decide whether application passwords stay https-only on onion hosts; and let `files/mu-plugins/infinito-oidc-rbac-mapper.php` drop an over-long website claim instead of failing the whole profile sync of that user."
msgstr ""

msgid "The project licence governs this repository's own code. It does not reach the software a role deploys, and that software is where the restriction usually sits: a deployment holding written permission for commercial use of Infinito.Nexus is still barred from NLLB-200's weights, which are CC BY-NC."
