# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role installs ``dockreap`` using Python tooling and runs it with the ``--no-confirmation`` flag to ensure automatic, non-interactive cleanup."
msgstr "Majukumu ya ufungaji ``dockreap`` kutumia Python na kuendesha kwa kutumia ``--no-confirmation`` bendera ili kuhakikisha safi ya moja kwa moja, isiyo ya ndani."

