msgid "The role pins `replicas: 1` because PHP keeps its sessions in container-local files and the `nfrastack/fusiondirectory:1.5` image carries neither the redis nor the memcached extension (measured: `php -m` lists only `session`). web-app-lam solves the same problem with a redis session handler, which needs an extension this image cannot supply: it runs PHP 7.4.33 on Alpine 3.15, both end of life. Upstream's last release is 1.5 (February 2025), but its default branch is `php8` and carried nine commits in the four weeks to 2026-10-04, so a PHP 8 release is in sight. Options: when that release lands, rebuild the image on it and replace the replica pin with the redis session handler web-app-lam uses."
msgstr ""

msgid "The role plans nothing. Every key, address and peer list is written into the inventory beforehand by ``cli.administration.inventory.mesh``, the one pass that sees every host at once; this role renders what its own host was handed and then proves the result. It acts on every host in the ``svc-net-wireguard`` group; outside swarm mode a host the mesh CLI gave no mesh is skipped."
msgstr ""

msgid "The role plans nothing. Every key, address and peer list is written into the inventory beforehand by `cli.administration.inventory.mesh`, the one pass that sees every host at once; this role renders what its own host was handed and then proves the result. It acts on every host in the `svc-net-wireguard` group; outside swarm mode a host the mesh CLI gave no mesh is skipped."
msgstr ""

msgid "The role probes whether the filesystem of the volume clones files. Without reflinks the deploy stops until `applications.svc-db-postgres.services.postgres.upgrade.backup_confirmed: true` is set after a backup."
