msgstr "Jukumu hutoa msingi wa kazi za SSH na imeundwa kutumika kama utegemezi na majukumu mengine ambayo yanahitaji utendaji wa SSH."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role provisions new GitLab instances. Volumes, secrets and backups of a pre-CNG Omnibus deployment (``gitlab_config``, ``gitlab_data``, ``/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json``) are not migrated or restorable into the CNG layout; deploy against a fresh database and empty volumes."
msgstr "Jukumu hilo jipya GitLab matukio. Volume, siri na backups ya kupelekwa kwa Omnibus kabla ya CNG (``gitlab_config``, Kwa hivyo, ``gitlab_data``, Kwa hivyo, ``/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json``) si kuhama au restorable katika CNG mpangilio; kupeleka dhidi ya database mpya na kiasi tupu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The role provisions new GitLab instances. Volumes, secrets and backups of a pre-CNG Omnibus deployment (`gitlab_config`, `gitlab_data`, `/etc/gitlab/gitlab-secrets.json`) are not migrated or restorable into the CNG layout; deploy against a fresh database and empty volumes."
