msgid "The role runs the upstream ``ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome`` image behind the central reverse proxy on its own canonical domain. Everything the application keeps lives in one volume at ``/data``: the SQLite database, uploaded media, and installed apps. The administrator account is provisioned from the role’s generated credential, and the role finishes the upstream first-boot wizard over the API so the front page renders a login form instead of a setup screen."
msgstr "Sehemu ya Juu Inaongoza ``ghcr.io/social-home-io/socialhome`` Picha nyuma ya wakala mkuu wa reverse kwenye uwanja wake wa Canonical. Kila kitu kinahifadhiwa katika kiasi kimoja ``/data``: Database ya SQLite, imepakiwa vyombo vya habari, na programu zilizowekwa. Akaunti ya msimamizi hutolewa kutoka kwa credential inayotokana na jukumu, na jukumu linamaliza mchawi wa kwanza wa kikundi juu ya API Kwa hiyo ukurasa wa mbele hutoa fomu ya kuingia badala ya skrini ya usanidi."

