msgid "The role ships persistent CLI tests under ``files/test/`` and a ``test.env.j2`` entry for the existing CLI harness. A unified-profile deploy also installs and runs these tests immediately as the workstation user. They check the deployed settings and use temporary homes to exercise the actual ``claude-mode``, Claude authentication status, native recognition of the deployed Code profile, and installation of an offline fixture extension into a temporary profile. They also check the actual SDK model picker, native ``/context`` output and installed agent extensions in the deployed profile. They do not change the real user’s connection mode or making provider requests. Hosts without unified mode report an explicit skip through the shared harness."
