# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Thin orchestrator: each variable's mapping/computation lives in its own module under :mod:`utils.env.handlers`. ``build_env`` walks the ``ORDERED_HANDLERS`` registry, letting each handler read/write through an :class:`EnvBuilder`."
msgstr "Muandaaji nyembamba: ramani ya kila variable / conputation huishi katika moduli yake mwenyewe :mod:`utils.env.handlers`... ``build_env`` Barabara ya ``ORDERED_HANDLERS`` Usajili, kuruhusu kila mtumiaji kusoma / kuandika kupitia :class:`EnvBuilder`..."

