# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This **Infinito.Nexus Presentation** is a tool designed for showcasing the Infinito.Nexus platform to various audiences, including **Administrators**, **Developers**, **End-Users**, **Businesses**, and **Investors**. The presentation leverages **Reveal.js** to create an interactive, engaging, and fully containerized experience that can be easily deployed with Docker."
msgstr "Hii ni **Infinito.Nexus Presentation** Ni chombo kilichotengenezwa kwa ajili ya kuonyesha Infinito.Nexus mbalimbali kwa wananchi, ikiwa ni pamoja na **Wasimamizi**Kwa hivyo, **Waendelezaji**Kwa hivyo, **Watumiaji wa mwisho**Kwa hivyo, **Biashara ya Biashara**Aidha, na **Wawekezaji**Uwasilishaji **Reveal.js** Kujenga maingiliano, kujihusisha, na kikamilifu containerized uzoefu ambayo inaweza kutumika kwa urahisi na Docker."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This 3-node topology (1 manager + 2 workers) is also the minimum exercised by the CI pilot workflow — see [CI: pilot validation workflow](#ci-pilot-validation-workflow). Any host in `svc-swarm-manager` MUST also be in `svc-swarm-node`. A deploy with a host in `svc-swarm-manager` but missing from `svc-swarm-node` MUST fail at inventory-validation time."
msgstr "Hii ni 3Orodha ya topolojia (1 Usimamizi wa + 2 Wafanyakazi wa) Pia ni kiwango cha chini kinachotumiwa na kazi ya majaribio ya CI - angalia [CI: Uthibitisho wa majaribio](#ci-pilot-validation-workflow). Mgeni yeyote katika `svc-swarm-manager` Lazima pia kuwa katika `svc-swarm-node`· Kuwa na jeshi ndani ya `svc-swarm-manager` Lakini bila ya kuwa na `svc-swarm-node` Lazima kushindwa wakati wa hesabu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the installation and configuration of [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/), a free and open-source tool for automating the deployment of [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) certificates. It also handles the setup of DNS plugins for ACME challenges."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linaunganisha ufungaji na usanidi wa [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/), chombo cha bure na cha wazi cha kuendesha kupelekwa kwa [Kwa hiyo, hebu tufungue](https://letsencrypt.org/) wa vyeti. Pia inashughulikia usanidi wa programu za DNS kwa changamoto za ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the installation and configuration of `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__, a free and open-source tool for automating the deployment of `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ certificates. It also handles the setup of DNS plugins for ACME challenges."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linaunganisha ufungaji na usanidi wa `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__, chombo cha bure na cha wazi cha kuendesha kupelekwa kwa `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ wa vyeti. Pia inashughulikia usanidi wa programu za DNS kwa changamoto za ACME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role automates the integration of Matomo tracking code into NGINX-served websites. It simplifies the process of adding the Matomo analytics tracking script and image tracker to all your web pages served through NGINX."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linaunganisha ushirikiano wa Matomo Kufuatilia msimbo katika tovuti za NGINX zilizohifadhiwa. kurahisisha mchakato wa kuongeza Matomo Analytics kufuatilia script na picha tracker kwa kurasa zako zote za wavuti aliwahi kupitia NGINX."

