msgid "This Ansible role manages the configuration of `systemd-journald` on target hosts."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linasimamia utekelezaji wa `systemd-journald` Kuwa na malengo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role manages the system locale configuration by deploying ``locale.gen`` and ``locale.conf``, then generating the requested locales."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la ajabu linasimamia usanidi wa mfumo wa ndani kwa kupeleka ``locale.gen`` Aidha, na ``locale.conf``, Baada ya hapo, tengeneza vifaa vilivyohitajika."

