msgstr "Taarifa hii ni kwa ajili ya `dsk-qbittorrent` Jukumu la ndani ya `infinito` ya kuhifadhi. Jukumu hili ni hasa crafted kwa ajili ya kufunga qBittorrent, maarufu wazi chanzo torrent mteja, kwenye kompyuta binafsi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This WordPress setup integrates several powerful plugins to extend functionality with authentication, federation, and external discussion platforms:"
msgstr "Hii ni WordPress kuanzisha inaunganisha Plugins kadhaa zenye nguvu ili kupanua utendaji na uthibitishaji, shirikisho, na majukwaa ya majadiliano ya nje:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This also enables **fork PRs** to pull images without needing upstream credentials, because the mirror is public."
msgstr "Hii pia itawezesha **Kwa upande wa PR** Kuvuta picha bila kuhitaji sifa za upstream, kwa sababu kioo ni umma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This also restarts `docker.service` and then calls `make network-refresh`, so the running Infinito development stack is recreated when one is active and the new setting reaches fresh container network namespaces."
msgstr "Hii pia itaanzisha `docker.service` Baada ya maombi `make network-refresh`, hivyo mbio Infinito maendeleo stack ni recreated wakati mmoja ni kazi na kuweka mpya kufikia mpya chombo mtandao namespaces."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This automated Docker Compose deployment streamlines the process by building a custom WordPress image (which includes tools like msmtp for email delivery) and configuring the necessary PHP settings, ensuring that your WordPress site is secure, scalable, and always up to date."
msgstr "Hii ni moja kwa moja Docker Compose Utekelezaji wa mradi huo kwa kujenga miundombinu ya WordPress Picha ya picha (ambayo inajumuisha zana kama msmtp kwa utoaji wa barua pepe) Kusimamia mipangilio ya PHP muhimu, kuhakikisha kwamba WordPress Tovuti ni salama, scalable, na daima hadi sasa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This avoids ABI and SONAME mismatches on rolling or less frequently rebuilt distributions."
msgstr "Hii inaepuka ABI na SONAME mismatches juu ya rolling au chini ya mara kwa mara upya usambazaji."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This avoids brittle parents[N] assumptions and fixes \"cli/cli/...\" path bugs."
msgstr "Hii ni kutokana na wazazi wa marehemu[ya ya ya] Mawazo na mapendekezo \"cli/cli/...\" Barabara ya Bukoba."

