# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role configures an `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__ server to host a static HTML homepage securely over HTTPS. It automates domain configuration, SSL/TLS certificate retrieval using `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__, and ensures your site is ready for production with minimal setup."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__ Seva ya mwenyeji wa ukurasa wa HTML wa tuli salama juu ya HTTPS. Inaunganisha usanidi wa kikoa, cheti cha SSL / TLS kwa kutumia `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__, na kuhakikisha tovuti yako ni tayari kwa ajili ya uzalishaji na kuanzisha ndogo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role core role for Nginx HTML injection of Matomo, theming, iFrame and JS snippets based on application feature flags."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la msingi kwa sindano ya Nginx HTML Matomo, theming, iFrame na JS snippets kulingana na bendera ya kipengele cha maombi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role create Cloudflare wildcard DNS records (*.parent) for parent hosts; no base or*.apex records."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaunda kumbukumbu za Cloudflare wildcard DNS (*Wazazi) kwa wazazi wao; bila ya msingi wala*Taarifa ya AP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a dedicated administrator user for local administrative tasks. The administrator account is configured to require a password when executing [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo), ensuring secure privilege escalation. For security reasons, it is recommended to use this dedicated administrator user instead of the default root account."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaunda mtumiaji aliyejitolea kwa kazi za kiutawala za mitaa. Akaunti ya msimamizi imewekwa ili kuhitaji nenosiri wakati wa kutekeleza [ya sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo), Kuhakikisha upatikanaji wa haki. Kwa sababu za usalama, inashauriwa kutumia mtumiaji huyu aliyejitolea badala ya akaunti ya mizizi ya default."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a dedicated administrator user for local administrative tasks. The administrator account is configured to require a password when executing `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__, ensuring secure privilege escalation. For security reasons, it is recommended to use this dedicated administrator user instead of the default root account."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaunda mtumiaji aliyejitolea kwa kazi za kiutawala za mitaa. Akaunti ya msimamizi imewekwa ili kuhitaji nenosiri wakati wa kutekeleza `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__, Kuhakikisha upatikanaji wa haki. Kwa sababu za usalama, inashauriwa kutumia mtumiaji huyu aliyejitolea badala ya akaunti ya mizizi ya default."

