# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role gives every other role one place to put packet filter rules. A role that needs them writes ``templates/nftables.conf.j2`` declaring its own nftables table and includes this role; the fragment is rendered to ``/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf``, checked, loaded, and read back, so a deploy fails rather than quietly leaving a gap. Deployed on its own, the role installs nftables, the ruleset that loads every fragment, and the ``nftables.service`` that replays them at boot."
msgstr "Sehemu hii inatoa kila nafasi moja ya kuweka kanuni za kuchuja pakiti. Kazi ambayo inahitaji kuandika ``templates/nftables.conf.j2`` kutangaza meza yake mwenyewe nftables na ni pamoja na jukumu hili; kipande ni kutolewa kwa ``/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf``, checked, kubeba, na kusoma nyuma, hivyo kupelekwa inashindwa badala ya kimya kuacha pengo. Imetumiwa peke yake, jukumu linafunga nftables, sheria ambazo hubeba kila kipande, na ``nftables.service`` Hii inawaweka kwenye mtego."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role gives every other role one place to put packet filter rules. A role that needs them writes `templates/nftables.conf.j2` declaring its own nftables table and includes this role; the fragment is rendered to `/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf`, checked, loaded, and read back, so a deploy fails rather than quietly leaving a gap. Deployed on its own, the role installs nftables, the ruleset that loads every fragment, and the `nftables.service` that replays them at boot."
msgstr "Sehemu hii inatoa kila nafasi moja ya kuweka kanuni za kuchuja pakiti. Kazi ambayo inahitaji kuandika `templates/nftables.conf.j2` kutangaza meza yake mwenyewe nftables na ni pamoja na jukumu hili; kipande ni kutolewa kwa `/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf`, checked, kubeba, na kusoma nyuma, hivyo kupelekwa inashindwa badala ya kimya kuacha pengo. Imetumiwa peke yake, jukumu linafunga nftables, sheria ambazo hubeba kila kipande, na `nftables.service` Hii inawaweka kwenye mtego."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role guarantees the workstation account before any desktop role writes for it."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linahakikisha akaunti ya worktation kabla ya jukumu lolote la desktop linaandika kwa hiyo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role health-check for Btrfs filesystems, alerts on any device error counters."
msgstr "Jukumu hili la kuangalia afya kwa mifumo ya faili ya Btrfs, tahadhari juu ya counters yoyote ya hitilafu ya kifaa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects Matomo analytics tracking code and noscript image tracker into Nginx-served HTML pages."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linajumuisha Matomo Msimbo wa ufuatiliaji wa uchambuzi na msimbo wa picha ya noscript ndani ya kurasa za HTML za Nginx zilizohifadhiwa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects a JS snippet into HTML to notify parent windows of iframe location changes and force external links to new tabs."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaingiza snippet ya JS katika HTML ili kuwajulisha madirisha mzazi wa mabadiliko ya eneo la iframe na kulazimisha viungo vya nje kwa tabo mpya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects a catcher that intercepts all logout elements in HTML pages served by NGINX and redirects them to a centralized logout endpoint via JavaScript."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaingiza catcher ambayo inazuia vipengele vyote vya logout katika kurasa za HTML zilizotumiwa na NGINX na kuelekeza tena kwenye kituo cha mwisho cha kati kupitia JavaScript."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into Nginx-served HTML responses via sub_filter."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linaingiza snippet ya JavaScript katika majibu ya HTML ya Nginx kupitia sub_filter..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs **GNOME Terminal**, the official terminal emulator for the GNOME desktop environment. GNOME Terminal provides a modern, feature-rich command-line interface for users on Arch Linux."
msgstr "Sehemu hii ya ufungaji **GNOME Terminal**emulator ya mwisho kwa mazingira ya desktop ya GNOME. Kituo cha GNOME hutoa interface ya kisasa, yenye utajiri wa amri kwa watumiaji kwenye Arch Linux."

msgid "This role installs Blender on a workstation and connects it to the coding agents the same host deploys, so a model can drive the scene instead of only describing it."
msgstr ""

