# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages GNOME Shell extensions by ensuring user extensions are enabled and by installing the CLI GNOME Extension Manager. The CLI tool facilitates the configuration and control of GNOME extensions via the command line."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasimamia Shell Upanuzi kwa kuhakikisha upanuzi wa mtumiaji unawezeshwa na kwa kufunga Meneja wa Upanuzi wa CLI GNOME. Chombo cha CLI kinawezesha usanidi na udhibiti wa upanuzi wa GNOME kupitia mstari wa amri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages the generation and handling of an SSH key for the [root user](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser) on a target system. It ensures that an SSH key is generated if one does not already exist and outputs the public key, enabling secure SSH access for the root user in automated environments."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasimamia kizazi na utunzaji wa ufunguo wa SSH kwa [Watumiaji wa](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser) kwenye mfumo wa malengo. Inahakikisha kwamba ufunguo wa SSH unazalishwa ikiwa mtu hayupo tayari na hutoa ufunguo wa umma, kuwezesha upatikanaji salama wa SSH kwa mtumiaji wa mizizi katika mazingira ya kiotomatiki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role manages the generation and handling of an SSH key for the `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__ on a target system. It ensures that an SSH key is generated if one does not already exist and outputs the public key, enabling secure SSH access for the root user in automated environments."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linasimamia kizazi na utunzaji wa ufunguo wa SSH kwa `root user <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superuser>`__ kwenye mfumo wa malengo. Inahakikisha kwamba ufunguo wa SSH unazalishwa ikiwa mtu hayupo tayari na hutoa ufunguo wa umma, kuwezesha upatikanaji salama wa SSH kwa mtumiaji wa mizizi katika mazingira ya kiotomatiki."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role monitors the health status of Docker containers on the system. It detects containers that are either **unhealthy** or have **exited with a non-zero code**, and triggers alerts if issues are found."
msgstr "Jukumu hili linafuatilia hali ya afya ya vyombo vya Docker kwenye mfumo. Aidha, imebaini kuwa vyombo ambavyo **Afya isiyo na afya** au kuwa na **Kuunganishwa na msimbo usio wa sifuri**, na kusababisha tahadhari ikiwa masuala yanapatikana."

