# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into ``config.php``, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "Sehemu hii inatoa jumla ya Nextcloud Matumizi ya Docker Compose· Inasimamia ujenzi wa Nextcloud utekelezaji pamoja na msingi wake MariaDB database na configure mfumo kwa ajili ya upatikanaji salama wa umma kupitia NGINX reverse wakala. Uunganisho wa moja kwa moja unajumuisha kuunganisha katika ``config.php``, afya hundi routines, na msaada jumuishi kwa ajili ya Backup na uokoaji shughuli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into `config.php`, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "Sehemu hii inatoa jumla ya Nextcloud Matumizi ya Docker Compose· Inasimamia ujenzi wa Nextcloud utekelezaji pamoja na msingi wake MariaDB database na configure mfumo kwa ajili ya upatikanaji salama wa umma kupitia NGINX reverse wakala. Uunganisho wa moja kwa moja unajumuisha kuunganisha katika `config.php`, afya hundi routines, na msaada jumuishi kwa ajili ya Backup na uokoaji shughuli."

# zaidi ya GitHub Actions wenyewe mwenyeji wa CI wakimbiaji Infinito.Nexus.
# Kila mchezaji anaendesha kama chombo cha ephemeral Docker (DooD - Docker nje
# ya Docker): s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s
# s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s
# s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s `/var/run/docker.sock` Na hutumia
# kuanza chombo kipya cha Infinito DinD kwa kila kazi ya CI, kisha machozi
# wakati kazi itakapomalizika.
msgid "This role provisions a dedicated machine as one or more GitHub Actions self-hosted CI runners for Infinito.Nexus. Each runner instance runs as an ephemeral Docker container (DooD — Docker out of Docker): the container mounts the host's `/var/run/docker.sock` and uses it to start a fresh Infinito DinD container for each CI job, then tears it down when the job finishes."
msgstr ""

# zaidi ya GitHub Actions wenyewe mwenyeji wa CI wakimbiaji Infinito.Nexus.
# Kila mchezaji anaendesha kama chombo cha ephemeral Docker (DooD - Docker nje
