# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Tool categories exposed at the pinned version cover issues and work items, merge requests (including diffs and conflicts), pipelines and jobs, labels, project and group search, repository files and commits, and instance metadata. The set includes mutating tools (``create_merge_request``, ``create_workitem_note``, ``link_work_items``). GitLab enforces no server-side read-only mode: the ``mcp`` scope grants both read and create access, and the only restriction mechanism is the per-request ``X-Gitlab-Enabled-Mcp-Server-Tools`` header, which the clients in this repository do not send. ``mcp.tools.read_only_default`` and ``mcp.tools.mutating_tools_enabled`` are declarative metadata, not an enforced policy. Every tool call runs with the blast radius of the ``root`` account."
msgstr "Makundi ya zana yaliyofunuliwa katika masuala ya kufunika toleo la pinned na vitu vya kazi, kuunganisha maombi (pamoja na migogoro na migogoro), mabomba na kazi, maandiko, mradi na kundi kutafuta, faili kuhifadhi na kufanya, na metadata mfano. Mfumo huu unajumuisha vifaa vya kubadilisha (``create_merge_request``, Kwa hivyo, ``create_workitem_note``, Kwa hivyo, ``link_work_items``)GitLab inatekeleza hakuna njia ya kusoma kwa upande wa seva tu: ``mcp`` wigo misaada wote kusoma na kujenga upatikanaji, na pekee kizuizi utaratibu ni kwa mara ``X-Gitlab-Enabled-Mcp-Server-Tools`` Mkuu, ambayo wateja katika hifadhi hii si kutuma. ``mcp.tools.read_only_default`` Aidha, na ``mcp.tools.mutating_tools_enabled`` Ni muhimu kuamua metadata, sio sera ya kutekelezwa. Kila simu ya mkononi inaendeshwa na radius ya mlipuko ``root`` Akaunti ya."

