# wa wa wa wa wa wa ``<entity>:<internal>`` (Alias ya overlay) Kwa upande wa
# mbele, au ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` Kwa jina la sidecars (wa wa
# wa wa wa wa wa wa)A. Kuwa ``host_gateway`` programu anaendesha node-local
# chini ya kundi na kuchapisha bandari yake ya ndani kwa mwenyeji, hivyo
# wakala overlay-kushikamana anaifikia katika ``host.docker.internal:<local>``
# Kwa njia ya lango la mwenyeji (the the the the the the the the the the the
# the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the
# the the the DEPLOYMENT_MODE, Kwa kuwa programu hizi zina nguvu ya
# kutengeneza)Kukosekana kwa bandari ya ndani ya bandari ngumu.
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
