# `meta/variants.yml`, the the the the the the the the the the the the the the
# the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the the
# `CombinedResolver` Kutembea kwa miguu `dependencies` Aidha, na
# `shared:`-edges katika lahaja-merged huduma ramani na bendera Jinja ni
# tathmini wakati kupeleka dhidi ya `group_names`... `run_after` Hakuna haja
# ya kuingizwa (Hii ni ishara ya wazi ya), hivyo lahaja ambayo Disables huduma
# haina kupata mtoa huduma re-added kupitia makali kuagiza. Moduli hii
# inamiliki azimio ambalo njia inahitaji na kitu kingine chochote; ramani za
# huduma za aina tofauti hutoka `utils.roles.applications.variants`, ambayo
# uteuzi wa CI hutatua kufungwa kwake pia.
msgid "When NO primary app ships a `meta/variants.yml`, the planner falls back to this path — the `CombinedResolver` walks `dependencies` and `shared:`-edges in the variant-merged services map and Jinja flags are evaluated at deploy time against `group_names`. `run_after` is NOT followed for inclusion (it is a pure ordering hint), so a variant that disables a service does not get the provider re-added through the ordering edge. This module owns the include resolution that path needs and nothing else; the round's variant-merged services maps come from `utils.roles.applications.variants`, which the CI selection resolves its closure from as well."
msgstr ""

