msgid "When OIDC and/or LDAP are enabled, local password login is deprioritised; users authenticate via the configured provider(s)."
msgstr "Wakati OIDC na / au LDAP zinawezeshwa, kuingia kwa nenosiri la ndani ni deprioritized; watumiaji huthibitisha kupitia mtoa huduma aliyeundwa(ya s)..."

