msgid "You MUST NOT rewrite large upstream style blocks when a focused override or token remapping is enough."
msgstr "Haupaswi kuandika upya vitalu vikubwa vya mtindo wa upstream wakati unaozingatia au kurekebisha ishara ni ya kutosha."

