msgid "You MUST NOT use the full URL as link text. Use the domain name, `here`, or the filename instead. Never use the full path."
msgstr "Huna haja ya kutumia URL kamili kama maandishi ya kiungo. Tumia jina la kikoa, `here`, au jina la chama badala yake. Kamwe usitafute njia ya mkato."

