msgid "You MUST add new user defaults in the owning role:"
msgstr "Unapaswa kuongeza defaults mpya ya mtumiaji katika jukumu la kumiliki:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST add or update integration tests for every `*.py` file you touch when the change affects behavior across module or runtime boundaries."
msgstr "Lazima kuongeza au update uchunguzi wa ushirikiano kwa kila mmoja `*.py` faili wewe kugusa wakati mabadiliko huathiri tabia katika moduli au mipaka ya muda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST add or update unit tests for every `*.py` file you touch."
msgstr "Lazima kuongeza au update kitengo vipimo kwa kila mmoja `*.py` Bonyeza kitufe cha kuingia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST add the smallest possible theming layer on top of the role's existing CSS."
msgstr "Lazima kuongeza safu ndogo iwezekanavyo ya theming juu ya CSS zilizopo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST apply all rules from `AGENTS.md` and `docs/contributing/` to every affected file, not only code rules, but also documentation, naming, structure, and any other applicable guidelines."
msgstr "Unapaswa kutumia sheria zote kutoka `AGENTS.md` Aidha, na `docs/contributing/` Kwa kila faili iliyoathirika, sio tu sheria za kanuni, lakini pia nyaraka, majina, muundo, na miongozo mingine yoyote inayofaa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST apply these repo-wide rules when you add, move, or review files:"
