# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST fix nearby wording and semantic issues when you touch a file, and correct obvious nearby issues proactively in the same pass."
msgstr "Unapaswa kurekebisha masuala ya karibu ya maneno na semantic unapogusa faili, na kurekebisha masuala ya karibu kwa ufanisi katika kupita sawa."

