msgid "You MUST inspect the start page AND the login page of the role as part of the end-to-end run. These two pages surface most navigation, authentication, and first-load regressions that later assertions would only catch indirectly."
msgstr "Lazima kukagua ukurasa wa mwanzo na ukurasa wa kuingia wa jukumu kama sehemu ya mwisho hadi mwisho wa kukimbia. kurasa hizi mbili uso urambazaji zaidi, uthibitishaji, na regressions kwanza-load kwamba madai baadaye itakuwa tu catch moja kwa moja."

