# shirikisho kati ya ActivityPub (ya wafadhili)Itifaki ya AT (Bluesky)Mtandao
# wa IndieWeb (Mtandao na microformats2)Inaangalia utambulisho na mwingiliano
# wa mtandao wa msalaba ili chapisho kwenye mtandao mmoja linafikia wafuasi
# kwenye wengine.
msgid "[Bridgy Fed](https://fed.brid.gy/) is a federation bridge between ActivityPub (the Fediverse), the AT Protocol (Bluesky), and the IndieWeb (webmentions and microformats2). It mirrors identities and cross-network interactions so a post on one network reaches followers on the others."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) at the repository root holds the most recent releases inline. Older releases live one-file-per-version under [docs/changelog/](../../changelog/), linked from the `## Older Releases` section at the bottom of the active changelog."
msgstr "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) Katika mizizi ya kuhifadhi ina inline ya hivi karibuni ya releases. Previous articleMauaji ya risasi yaua mmoja [Badilisha / Badilisha](../../changelog/), Kuunganishwa kutoka kwa `## Older Releases` Sehemu ya chini ya mabadiliko ya kazi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) is trimmed; every older entry is written to its own file under [docs/changelog/](../../changelog/) named `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, and the `## Older Releases` index at the bottom of the active changelog is rebuilt from the archive directory listing so it never drifts away from what is on disk."
msgstr "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) Kila kitu kinafanywa kwa njia ya barua pepe, na kila kitu kinafanywa kwa njia yake mwenyewe. [Badilisha / Badilisha](../../changelog/) Jina la jina `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, Aidha, kwa kuwa `## Older Releases` index chini ya changelog kazi ni upya kutoka orodha archive directory hivyo kamwe drifts mbali na kile ni juu ya disk."

