# Caveman](https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman) Ni Plugin ya kuunganisha
# iliyowekwa kupitia `make install-skills`. Inapunguza matumizi ya ishara ya
# pato kupitia mitindo ya mawasiliano ya terser. `make install-skills` na
# uwezo wa kufanya kazi kwa mujibu wa Kanuni za Bunge kama
# `INFINITO_SKILLS_REPOSITORY` Katika uzalishaji wa `.env` (Kupitia kwa
# `custom.env`, kuona kuwa `docs/contributing/customize.md`)Kwa kuwa [Ujuzi wa
# ujuzi](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/skills) s s s s s s s s s s s
# s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s s
# s s s `skills-lock.json` Pia inaunga mkono shughuli za kimataifa kupitia
# `make install`. Hii inafanya kazi kwa mawakala wote wa mkono: Claude Code,
# CodexKwa mfano, Gemini CLI, CursorCopilot, Windsurf, Cline, na zaidi.
msgid "[Caveman](https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman) is a token-compression plugin installed via `make install-skills`. It reduces output token consumption through progressively terser communication styles. `make install-skills` copies the skills from the repository pinned as `INFINITO_SKILLS_REPOSITORY` in the generated `.env` (override via `custom.env`, see `docs/contributing/customize.md`); the [skills](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/skills) repository pins every skill in its `skills-lock.json` and also supports global installs via its own `make install`. This works universally across all supported agents: Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf, Cline, and more."
msgstr ""

