msgid "[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/) is an autonomous agent runtime. This role runs it in embodied mode: on a machine that is dedicated to it, with direct access to the hardware of that machine. Where the container roles put a kernel boundary between the agent and its host, here the boundary is the device itself."
msgstr "[Wakala wa Hermes](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/) Ni mchezaji huru wa muda. Jukumu hili linaendesha katika hali iliyojumuishwa: kwenye mashine iliyojitolea nayo, na ufikiaji wa moja kwa moja kwa vifaa vya mashine hiyo. Ambapo majukumu ya chombo huweka mpaka wa kernel kati ya wakala na mwenyeji wake, hapa mpaka ni kifaa yenyewe."

