msgid "[`svc-ai-litellm`](../svc-ai-litellm/) publishes one routing alias. When this service is deployed, the gateway's pre-call hook asks it which of the eligible models should answer, passing the prompt as the state and the surviving aliases as the options of a single `choice` question. `services.litellm.router.strategy` follows `services.s1.enabled`, so deploying this role is what switches the gateway from a weighted score to a System One decision."
msgstr "[`svc-ai-litellm`](../svc-ai-litellm/) Bonyeza kitufe cha \"Routing\". Wakati huduma hii inatumiwa, ndoano ya mlango wa mbele ya simu inauliza ni nani wa mifano inayofaa anapaswa kujibu, kupitisha haraka kama hali na akaases za kuishi kama chaguo la moja. `choice` swali la. `services.litellm.router.strategy` Yafuatayo ni yafuatayo yafuatayo `services.s1.enabled`, hivyo kupeleka jukumu hili ni nini kinachobadilisha lango kutoka alama ya uzito hadi System One uamuzi."

