# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] Usimamizi wa utekelezaji Flowise fixture kutekeleza deterministic MCP
# chombo kwa ufanisi na haina plaintext MCP credential. Rejesha ni Agentflow
# ambaye Tool node wito moja aitwaye chombo na hoja fasta kupitia
# `customMcpServerTool`, Kwa hiyo, wito ni uamuzi badala ya kushoto kwa mfano,
# na kupeleka anaendesha kupitia `/api/v1/prediction` na kushindwa kufanya
# kazi.200 Jibu au mwili wa makosa. Node hubeba ID ya kuingia ya Usajili tu:
# Mchukuzi anakaa katika FlowiseKuwa encrypted `authConfig`, ambayo mtihani wa
# kitengo unashikilia kwa kudai mtiririko wa mfululizo hauna ishara au neno.
# `Bearer`“Wagombea ni wale watatu ambao wanapokea Flowise, kila mmoja na
# chombo kusoma kwamba inachukua hoja; kwanza kusajiliwa ni kujengwa na
# kutekelezwa na stale fixtures kutoka anaendesha mapema ni kuondolewa.
msgid "[x] A deployment-managed Flowise fixture executes a deterministic MCP tool successfully and contains no plaintext MCP credential. The fixture is an Agentflow whose Tool node invokes one named tool with fixed arguments through `customMcpServerTool`, so the call is deterministic rather than left to a model, and the deploy runs it through `/api/v1/prediction` and fails on a non-200 answer or an error body. The node carries only the registry entry id: the bearer stays in Flowise's encrypted `authConfig`, which a unit test holds by asserting the serialised flow contains neither the token nor the word `Bearer`. The candidates are the three providers that admit Flowise, each with a read tool that takes no arguments; the first one registered is built and executed and stale fixtures from earlier runs are removed."
msgstr ""

