# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] Kila adapta iliyowezeshwa inathibitisha utambulisho halisi wa upstream na
# mipaka ya ruhusa, lengo la kudumu, ruhusu ya uendeshaji, ombi / majibu
# mipaka, muda, utangulizi, tabia ya drift ya schema, na tukio la ukaguzi
# lililofanywa upya. Mpaka wa ruhusa unapimwa kwa kupelekwa kwa uchunguzi wa
# kutengwa, ambao unazunguka ndani ya gari la kando na unalinganisha anwani
# zake mwenyewe dhidi ya mali zilizotangazwa, kwa hivyo kiambatisho cha pili
# mtu mwingine anakamatwa na utambulisho badala ya kuhesabu. Msaidizi wa
# operesheni anakataa chombo kisichojulikana na kubadilisha moja kwenye
# `tools/call` yenyewe, na sasa pia hoja ya chombo mwenyewe schema haina
# kufafanua. schema hiyo ilikuwa kuchapishwa kwa wateja na kamwe checked,
# ambayo alifanya ni pendekezo badala ya mipaka: juu ya njia ya openapi hoja
# mkataba haina jina ni alielekezwa kwa ombi upstream kama parameter swala,
# hivyo mteja anaweza kuongeza vigezo operesheni upya kamwe nafasi, na chombo
# kutangaza hakuna schema kukubalika chochote. Chombo ambacho kinatangaza
# hakuna pembejeo sasa inachukua hakuna, pembejeo inahitajika lazima iwepo, na
# ukaguzi unaendelea baada ya dari ya ukubwa hivyo mzigo mkubwa wa malipo bado
# unakataliwa kwa kuwa mkubwa. Hakuna vikwazo vya mkataba vilivyosafirishwa:
# chombo cha kusoma kila simu za uchunguzi wa kupeleka ni aidha zisizo na
# mpangilio na kuitwa wazi au kutangaza hakuna hoja inayohitajika, ambayo
# ilipimwa katika mikataba yote ya kumi na nne badala ya kudhaniwa. pagination
# inashikilia ukurasa ulioombwa na hurekebisha orodha ya matokeo kwenye dari
# zilizosainiwa; hash ya schema inakaguliwa wakati wa kuanza na mchakato
# unakataa kutumika kwenye drift; na rekodi ya ukaguzi imefungwa na mtihani
# unaodai seti yake muhimu, kwa sababu rekodi inayobeba hoja au mwili itakuwa
# nakala ya pili ya kile wanacholinda. Mipaka ilikaguliwa tofauti na mbili
# kati ya saba zilitangazwa na hazijatumika. Lengo la kudumu lilikuwa kitu
# kisicho na kitu nyuma yake, na kuikagua iligundua shimo halisi: adapta
# ilifungua mkondo wake na `urlopen`, ambayo ifuatavyo redirects, na URLlib
# nakala headers maombi ya awali kwenye lengo redirect, hivyo upstream kujibu
# `302` Na mahali pa kukaa mbali ingekuwa mikononi mwa adapta ya juu kwa
# yeyote aliyemwita. Mfunguaji sasa anakataa moja kwa moja, kwa sababu lengo
# lina mkataba na kuelekeza tena ni ukiukaji wa mkataba badala ya njia.
# Vidhibiti vinne vibaya vinashikilia mali nyingine: hoja ya mteja kumtaja
# mwenyeji mwingine, mmoja akijaribu kutoroka sehemu yake ya njia, na hoja
# isiyo na mkataba wote hukaa kwenye asili ya mkataba, kutua kwa mwisho katika
# kamba ya swala badala ya njia.
msgid "[x] Each enabled adapter proves the exact upstream identity and permission boundary, fixed target, operation allowlist, request/response limits, timeout, pagination, schema drift behavior, and redacted audit event. The permission boundary is measured per deployment by the isolation probe, which runs inside the sidecar and compares its own addresses against the declared subnets, so a second attachment someone else added is caught by identity rather than by counting. The operation allowlist refuses an unnamed tool and a mutating one on `tools/call` itself, and now also an argument the tool's own schema does not describe. That schema had been published to clients and never checked, which made it a suggestion rather than a boundary: on the openapi path an argument the contract does not name is appended to the upstream request as a query parameter, so a client could add parameters the reviewed operation never granted, and a tool declaring no schema accepted anything. A tool that declares no inputs now takes none, a required input must be present, and the check runs after the size ceiling so a large payload is still refused for being large. No shipped contract regresses: the read tool every deploy probe calls is either schema-free and called bare or declares no required argument, which was measured across all fourteen contracts rather than assumed. pagination clamps the requested page and truncates the result list to the contracted ceilings; the schema hash is checked at startup and the process refuses to serve on drift; and the audit record is pinned by a test asserting its exact key set, because a record carrying the arguments or the body would be a second copy of what it guards. The limits were audited separately and two of seven turned out to be declared and never applied. Fixed target was the item with nothing behind it, and auditing it found a real hole: the adapter opened its upstream with `urlopen`, which follows redirects, and urllib copies the original request's headers onto the redirect target, so an upstream answering `302` with an off-host location would have handed the adapter's upstream credential to whoever it named. The opener now refuses a redirect outright, since the target is contracted and a redirect is a contract violation rather than a route. Four negative controls hold the rest of the property: a client argument naming another host, one attempting to escape its path segment, and an uncontracted argument all stay on the contracted origin, the last landing in the query string rather than the path."
msgstr ""

# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] Kila mmoja anawezeshwa native/plugin/sidecar Mtoa huduma hupita mkono wa
# MCP uliothibitishwa, madai halisi ya mkataba wa chombo, wito mmoja wa kusoma
# kwa makusudi, kukataa kwa makusudi, kukataa hali ya ulemavu, na jaribio la
# matumizi. Nne kati ya sita kukimbia kwa kila kupeleka kupitia uchunguzi wa
# mkataba wa pamoja, ambayo inafungua kikao na credential iliyotangazwa,
# inalinganisha majina ya chombo kilichotumiwa dhidi ya ruhusu iliyorekodiwa,
# inaita chombo cha kusoma kwa uamuzi, na tofauti inathibitisha kuwa uchunguzi
# usio na jina na usiofaa ni kila mmoja alikataa kikao; kila uso uliowezeshwa
# wa kutumikia unajumuisha uchunguzi huo. Kutengwa kwa watumiaji hufanyika
# safu moja mapema, ambapo ni ya kuamua: ugunduzi unakataa mtumiaji mtoa
# huduma hana orodha katika `allowed_consumers` Kwa sababu jina lake, hivyo
# mteja asiyejulikana kamwe anakabidhiwa uaminifu katika nafasi ya kwanza.
# Kukataliwa kwa hali ya ulemavu ilikuwa pengo halisi na haikuwepo kwa namna
# yoyote. Kila mchezaji wa ndani wa MCP alijifunika kwenye bendera ya huduma
# na kuruka wakati uso ulikuwa mbali, ambayo inamaanisha uso ambao uliendelea
# kutumika baada ya kuzima ulikuwa hauelezeki kutoka kwa moja ambayo haijawahi
# kutumika. Msaidizi wa gating hakuwa na inverse, hivyo alipata moja, na madai
# ya pamoja ya usafiri-agnostic sasa inachunguza mwisho na GET na POST wakati
# bendera ni uongo na inashindwa kwenye jibu lolote ambalo linaonyesha kitu
# bado kusikiliza, kukataa credential ni pamoja na. Ni wired katika majukumu
# yote kumi kuwahudumia na chanjo lint inahitaji, ambayo ni jinsi ya kumi
# kupatikana: utawala flagged jukumu moja ambaye spec si jina kama wengine.
msgid "[x] Each enabled native/plugin/sidecar provider passes an authenticated MCP handshake, exact tool-contract assertion, one deterministic read call, wrong-credential rejection, disabled-state rejection, and consumer-isolation test. Four of the six run on every deploy through the shared contract probe, which opens a session with the declared credential, compares the served tool names against the recorded allowlist, calls the deterministic read tool, and separately proves that an anonymous and a wrong-credential probe are each refused a session; every enabled serving surface includes that probe. Consumer isolation is held one layer earlier, where it is decidable: discovery rejects a consumer the provider does not list in `allowed_consumers` with a named reason, so an unadmitted client is never handed the credential in the first place. Disabled-state rejection was the real gap and did not exist in any form. Every role-local MCP spec gated itself on the service flag and skipped when the surface was off, which means a surface that kept serving after being switched off was indistinguishable from one that was never deployed. The gating helper had no inverse, so it gained one, and a shared transport-agnostic assertion now probes the endpoint with both a GET and a POST while the flag is false and fails on any answer that shows something still listening, a refused credential included. It is wired into all ten serving roles and the coverage lint requires it, which is how the tenth was found: the rule flagged the one role whose spec is not named like the others."
msgstr ""

