# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] Kila jukumu la seva ya MCP linatangaza programu-scoped `mcp` Jukumu la
# RBAC, na kila mteja anatekeleza ruzuku ya seva inayolingana. Open WebUI
# inaweza kutatua au kuunda kitambulisho cha kikundi kisichotabirika kwa jina
# la kikundi na kuomba `access_grants` Kwa njia ya APIlakini bila ya kuwa na
# `roles: [mcp]`, uanachama wa matumizi mabaya, kuondolewa kwa kikundi cha
# mwisho, na upatanisho wa baada ya kuanza lazima uanzishwe na kupimwa kama
# ilivyoelezwa na mahitaji 035. Wote wanne walikuwa: `granted_roles` Acha ya
# `APPLICATION_SCOPED_ROLES` Jina la akaunti isiyo na ukomo
# (`test_rbac_scoped.py::test_an_unscoped_scoped_role_grants_nothing_anywhere`);
# Ruzuku ya wigo hufikia tu maombi yake mwenyewe, na ID ya kikundi cha mtoa
# huduma mwingine hairuhusu uunganisho
# (`test_mcp_tool_server_connections.py`); `reconcile_members` Weka kikundi
# kwa haki iliyowekwa badala ya kutegemea usawa wa madai
# (`test_provision_mcp_grants.py::test_a_group_that_lost_its_last_member_is_emptied`)Na
# kwa kipindi hicho Bw. `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`, Kwa hiyo, kuanzisha upya
# upya. Tamko lenyewe linatolewa na
# [test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py)...
msgid "[x] Every MCP server role declares an application-scoped `mcp` RBAC role, and each client enforces the corresponding server grant. Open WebUI MAY resolve or create its unpredictable local group identifier by group name and apply `access_grants` through the API, but unscoped `roles: [mcp]`, wrong-application membership, last-group removal, and post-restart reconciliation MUST be fixed and tested as defined by requirement 035. All four hold: `granted_roles` drops an `APPLICATION_SCOPED_ROLES` name declared unscoped (`test_rbac_scoped.py::test_an_unscoped_scoped_role_grants_nothing_anywhere`); a scoped grant reaches only its own application, and another provider's group id does not enable a connection (`test_mcp_tool_server_connections.py`); `reconcile_members` sets a group to exactly the entitled set rather than relying on the claim sync (`test_provision_mcp_grants.py::test_a_group_that_lost_its_last_member_is_emptied`); and the grant travels in `TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`, so a restart restores it. The declaration itself is held by [test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_server_rbac_role.py)."
msgstr ""

# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] Kila jukumu la seva ya MCP lina nyaraka ikiwa wito hufanya kama mtumiaji
# anayeomba, akaunti ya huduma, au msimamizi, na utekelezaji unathibitisha
# utambulisho halisi uliopewa. Orodha ya majina yaliyopendekezwa hapa
# imebadilishwa: `lookup('mcp_credential')` Kukamilisha ahadi ya mtoa huduma
# `mcp.credential.owner`, Kwa hivyo,
# `tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_no_administrator_token.py` Kumzuia
# mmiliki huyo kuwa `administrator` Na kuzuia code kazi kutoka kusoma
# `users.administrator.tokens`, Na kwa wote 24 Wajibu wa server `auth_subject:
# service_account` dhidi ya wahusika `mcp-<application_id>` Akaunti ya.
# Uchunguzi wa muda wa uthibitisho *Kama vile* Mmiliki huyo kabla ya kudai
# mkataba wa chombo, hivyo ishara ya mtu mwingine inashindwa kupeleka.
msgid "[x] Every MCP server role documents whether calls execute as the requesting user, a service account, or an administrator, and the implementation verifies the real provisioned identity. The lookup named here has since been replaced: `lookup('mcp_credential')` resolves the provider's declared `mcp.credential.owner`, `tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_no_administrator_token.py` forbids that owner from being `administrator` and forbids task code from reading `users.administrator.tokens`, and all 24 server roles declare `auth_subject: service_account` against a role-scoped `mcp-<application_id>` account. The deploy-time probe authenticates *as* that owner before asserting the tool contract, so a token belonging to anyone else fails the deploy."
msgstr ""

