# yaliyofichwa, huidhinisha kila kuingia, na kuthibitisha majina halisi ya
# chombo na schemas. Mpatanishi anakataa kujiandikisha mtoa huduma ambaye
# usafirishaji wake uliotangazwa sio jukumu linalotangaza, huhifadhi mbebaji
# kama muuzaji. `CUSTOM_HEADERS` `authConfig` Flowise Inaruhusu kupumzika, na
# inaruhusu kila kuingia. Uhakikisho wa jina ulikuwa wa hiari hadi sasa, kwa
# sababu kuingia kwa taka iliweka orodha ya chombo tupu; inalinganisha dhidi
# ya ruhusu ya mtoa huduma iliyotangazwa. Nusu ya schema inatekelezwa ambapo
# mkataba wa schema huishi: adapta inayohudumia pini hizo za zana
# `tools.schema_sha256` Kuwa wito `policy.assert_no_drift` katika startup,
# hivyo schema iliyopita inashindwa mtoa huduma badala ya kuwa re-checked
# kutoka kwa mteja ambayo haiwezi kuona mkataba faili.
msgid "[x] Flowise 3.1.4 is reconciled through `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers`, registers only Streamable HTTP providers, stores headers encrypted, authorizes each entry, and verifies exact tool names and schemas. The reconciler refuses to register a provider whose declared transport is not the one the role declares, stores the bearer as a `CUSTOM_HEADERS` `authConfig` Flowise encrypts at rest, and authorizes every entry. Name verification was vacuous until now, because the desired entry hardcoded an empty tool list; it compares against the provider's declared allowlist. The schema half is enforced where the schema contract lives: the adapter serving those tools pins `tools.schema_sha256` and calls `policy.assert_no_drift` at startup, so a changed schema fails the provider rather than being re-checked from a client that cannot see the contract file."
msgstr ""

# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] Flowise Msaada wa HTTP unaoweza kutiririka bado umezuiwa au kufungwa hadi
# kutolewa kwa chanzo kilichoonyeshwa kinapita simu ya zana ya mwisho hadi
# mwisho. Uchunguzi wa chanzo `flowise@3.1.4` Acha iwe:
# `MCPToolkit.initialize` Kuunganisha A `StreamableHTTPClientTransport` Kwanza
# na kisha kurudi nyuma `SSEClientTransport` tu wakati uhusiano huu
# unajitokeza, hivyo `'sse'` Huduma ya Usajili wa Jinai inachagua "Sio ya
# kijinga" badala ya usafiri. Docstring ya moduli yenyewe ilidai kinyume,
# kwamba watoa SSE tu wanaweza kusajiliwa, wakati `meta/mcp.yml` Imetangazwa
# kuwa `streamable_http`; Kwa hiyo, adhabu ya dhambi ni nusu ya dhambi.
# Mwisho-kwa-mwisho chombo wito ni kusimamiwa Agentflow fixture, ambayo
# utekelezaji kutekeleza na inashindwa.
msgid "[x] Flowise Streamable HTTP support remains blocked or bridged until a pinned source-audited release passes an end-to-end tool call. The source audit of `flowise@3.1.4` settles it: `MCPToolkit.initialize` connects a `StreamableHTTPClientTransport` first and falls back to `SSEClientTransport` only when that connection throws, so the `'sse'` literal the registry service passes selects \"not stdio\" rather than a transport. The role's own module docstring claimed the opposite, that only SSE providers could be registered, while `meta/mcp.yml` declared `streamable_http`; the docstring was the wrong half and is corrected. The end-to-end tool call is the managed Agentflow fixture, which the deploy executes and fails on."
msgstr ""

# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] FlowiseLicha ya hayo, OpenClawAidha, na8n kuthibitisha mipaka yao ya
# mtumiaji wa kila-server au ni vikwazo kwa nafasi ya admin-tu ya kazi au
# kikoa cha pekee cha uaminifu. Hatua ya nne; epuka kujidanganya wewe
# mwenyewe.2 Mlango unakubali tu maombi yenyewe `administrator` Aidha, na
# `mcp` Makundi hayo, ambayo yameundwa na
# [test_mcp_client_gate_scoped.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_client_gate_scoped.py),
# ambayo inamfanya mteja anunue kutoka `meta/mcp.yml` badala ya orodha.
# `web-app-n8n` Kuondolewa kwa no `allowed_groups` wakati wa kutangaza `mcp`
# Hakuna haja ya kuchukua hatua; mlango huu umefungwa.
msgid "[x] Flowise, Hermes, OpenClaw, and n8n prove their per-server user boundary or are restricted to an admin-only workspace/instance or isolated trust domain. All four take the restriction branch: their oauth2 gate admits only the application's own `administrator` and `mcp` groups, held there by [test_mcp_client_gate_scoped.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_client_gate_scoped.py), which derives the client set from `meta/mcp.yml` rather than a list. `web-app-n8n` shipped with no `allowed_groups` at all while declaring an `mcp` role nothing consulted; that gate is now closed."
