# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] Vyeti vya MCP hufuata asili yao. Siri ya kuanzishwa kwa chombo hiki
# (Ufunguo wa mwisho, siri ya programu iliyoshirikiwa) Imeelezwa kuwa katika
# jukumu la [`meta/secrets.yml`](../../roles/web-app-baserow/meta/secrets.yml)
# `credentials:` Matumizi na matumizi yake kupitia `lookup('config',
# application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`· Kujitegemea kwa maombi
# yenyewe (Mwaka mmoja API Ishara, ishara ya ufikiaji wa kibinafsi, nenosiri
# la programu) Hapaswi kutangazwa hapo, kwa sababu kuba haiwezi kuzalisha; ni
# minted dhidi ya kesi inayoendelea na kuendelea kupitia `sys-token-store`
# chini ya mtumiaji. Kwa njia yoyote, thamani haijawahi kuandikwa katika
# `README.md`, Kuchezawright athari, au yasiyo ya siri env vars.
msgid "[x] MCP credentials follow their origin. A secret this deployment generates (an endpoint key, a shared app secret) is declared in the role's [`meta/secrets.yml`](../../roles/web-app-baserow/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` block and consumed via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`. A credential the application itself issues (an API token, a personal access token, an app password) MUST NOT be declared there, because the vault cannot generate it; it is minted against the running instance and persisted through `sys-token-store` under the consuming user. Either way the value is never written into `README.md`, Playwright traces, or non-secret env vars."
msgstr ""

