# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] kawaida ya kawaida Flowise Watumiaji hawawezi kutumia MCP au node
# nyingine ya HTTP kufikia kitanzi, vituo vya metadata, ndege ya kudhibiti
# chombo, au huduma za ndani zisizohusiana; kuzuia ukaguzi wa SSRF pekee
# inashindwa kigezo hiki. `checkDenyList` Inatatua jina la mwenyeji na kupima
# kila anwani iliyotatuliwa, na orodha iliyojengwa inakataa RFC zote1918, Kwa
# hivyo kufikia mtoa huduma yeyote kwenye mtandao wa chombo haiwezekani wakati
# orodha ya kujengwa inatumika. Mabadiliko ya hali ya hewa si kubadili: na
# `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK=false` Orodha ya makosa ni sahihi `HTTP_DENY_LIST`
# Badala ya kujenga reli moja kwa wakati mmoja. Kwa hiyo jukumu linaweka
# kubadili na kutoa orodha ambayo bado inakataa kitanzi, kuunganisha-ndani,
# metadata ya wingu, nafasi ya multicast na iliyohifadhiwa, ambayo ni "Sio
# peke yake" mahitaji hayo. Huduma za ndani zisizohusiana zinashikiliwa na
# uanachama wa mtandao badala ya orodha, mpaka huo huo wa kutengwa kwa adapta
# unasema. Usanidi peke yake hauthibitishi chochote, kwa hivyo kupeleka
# inaonyesha kuingia kwa Usajili wa kutupa kwenye kitanzi na kwenye anwani ya
# metadata na inashindwa isipokuwa Flowise Wote wawili walikataa.
msgid "[x] Ordinary Flowise users cannot use MCP or another HTTP node to reach loopback, metadata endpoints, the container control plane, or unrelated internal services; globally disabling the SSRF check alone fails this criterion. `checkDenyList` resolves a hostname and tests every resolved address, and the built-in list denies all of RFC1918, so reaching any provider on a container network is impossible while the built-in list applies. Upstream's switch is not an off switch: with `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK=false` the deny list becomes exactly `HTTP_DENY_LIST` instead of the built-in one merged with it. The role therefore sets the switch and supplies a list that still denies loopback, link-local, cloud metadata, multicast and reserved space, which is the \"not alone\" this criterion demands. Unrelated internal services are held out by network membership rather than by the list, the same boundary the adapter isolation probe asserts. Configuration alone proves nothing, so the deploy points a throwaway registry entry at loopback and at the metadata address and fails unless Flowise refuses both."
msgstr ""

