# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] Vipimo vya mzunguko na Disablement kuthibitisha kwamba zamani credential
# ni kukataliwa, mpya credential kazi, na hakuna stale mteja kuingia huhifadhi
# upatikanaji. Mbili za kwanza zinaendesha kila kupeleka: uchunguzi wa mkataba
# wa pamoja unafungua uso na imani iliyotangazwa na inashindwa isipokuwa
# kusoma kwa makusudi kunafanikiwa, na tofauti inathibitisha uaminifu usiofaa
# unakataliwa kikao. Kila moja ya nyuso nane za huduma zilizowezeshwa ni
# pamoja na uchunguzi huo, kwa hivyo hakuna nusu inayodaiwa kwa majukumu
# fulani na kudhani kwa wengine. tatu ni unit-tested kwa mteja, na tu wateja
# watatu wanaweza kushikilia stale kuingia wakati wote, kwa sababu Hermes na
# OpenClaw Usiweke usajili wa upande wa seva: usanidi wao unafanywa kutoka kwa
# snapshot ya ugunduzi wa kukimbia mwenyewe, kwa hivyo hakuna kitu
# kilichoachwa nyuma kwenda stale. Bonyeza juu ya kuingia `authConfig` Aidha,
# na Open WebUI Orodha ya majina ambayo tayari yameshatajwa; na8n ilikuwa
# pengo na sasa inathibitisha kuwa mkimbiaji anachukua nafasi ya imani badala
# ya kuwa ikilinganishwa dhidi ya moja n8Kamwe mikono nyuma, upande wa seva na
# kwa kila mteja uaminifu. Kuangalia nusu ya tatu iligeuka uvujaji halisi
# kwenye njia. nextcloud inaingiza nywila ya programu chini ya jina
# lililosimamiwa na kamwe kufuta moja ya awali, hivyo kila kukimbia ambayo
# iligundua nywila iliyohifadhiwa kukataliwa aliongeza ishara nyingine halali
# kwenye akaunti wakati wale wa zamani waliendelea kupata kamili. Jina la
# kikoa ni jina la kikoa, na jina la kikoa lililopo tayari.
msgid "[x] Rotation and disablement tests prove that the old credential is rejected, the new credential works, and no stale client entry retains access. The first two run on every deploy: the shared contract probe opens the surface with the declared credential and fails unless a deterministic read succeeds, and separately proves a wrong credential is refused a session. Every one of the eight enabled serving surfaces includes that probe, so neither half is asserted for some roles and assumed for the rest. The third is unit-tested per client, and only three clients can hold a stale entry at all, because Hermes and OpenClaw keep no server-side registration: their configuration is rendered from the run's own discovery snapshot, so there is nothing left behind to go stale. Flowise overwrites the entry's `authConfig` and Open WebUI the registered connection, both already covered; n8n was the gap and now proves that a rotated bearer replaces the credential rather than being compared against one n8n never hands back, on the server side and for every client credential. Auditing the third half turned up a real leak on the way. Nextcloud mints an app password under a fixed managed name and never revoked the previous one, so every run that found the stored password rejected added another valid token to the account while the old ones kept full access. The mint is now preceded by a listing and the revocation of every token carrying that managed name."
msgstr ""

