# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] S ya S3 Watafsiri wanazuiliwa kutangaza ndoo kabla na list/head/get;
# Prometheus adapters kutekeleza mipaka ya kuangalia / rahisi; GraphQL na
# adapters ya SQL hukataa lugha za pembejeo za kiholela. **Hata hivyo, tatu
# kati ya hizo nne bado hazijapatikana:** pekee pekee pekee
# `openapi_allowlist` (10 Majukumu ya) Aidha, na `mcp_passthrough` (4)
# matumizi yake, na `test_mcp_schema.py` Kwa sasa inahitaji umakini `scope`
# Majina kabla ya `s3_prefix`, Kwa hivyo, `graphql_allowlist` au au au au
# `named_query` Ndege inaweza kuruka. Kwa kuwa Prometheus Sehemu hii ilikuwa
# ya kweli na sasa inafungwa nusu: `prometheus_query_range` Kukubali
# wateja-chosen `start`, Kwa hivyo, `end` Aidha, na `step`, Na kwa upande
# mwingine, ndege hiyo ilianguka bila `--query.timeout` Baada ya hapo,
# mtuhumiwa huyo aliachiwa baada ya 15S. Kuwa tayari Prometheus busy kwa ajili
# yake 2Dakika ya default. Jukumu la sasa ni la `--query.timeout` inayotokana
# na `mcp.limits.timeout_seconds`, Kwa hiyo, wawili hawawezi kwenda. **Nusu ya
# kuangalia sasa imefungwa pia, na dari ya sampuli imefungwa kwenye safu
# ambayo inaweza kubeba.** `policy.assert_range` Inaweka hesabu ya pointi ya
# swala kwa mkataba mwenyewe `result_items`: Ni chombo ambacho mpango wake
# unatangaza `start`Kwa hivyo, `end` Aidha, na `step` Imekuwa na `(end -
# start) / step + 1` ya ukaguzi wa hesabu hizo na imekataliwa na
# `range_too_wide` Hatua ndogo zaidi ambayo inaweza kuwa sawa. dhidi ya maisha
# Prometheus Mkataba, siku moja katika azimio la dakika moja unahitaji 1441
# Pointi dhidi ya kiwango cha juu 100 Hata hivyo, hakutajwa jina. 873Hatua ya
# pili. Hoja sio upole: adapta tayari imefungua majibu kama hayo 100 Kwa
# upande mwingine, ni vigumu sana kuosha vidonge kutoka kwenye vidonge, ikiwa
# ni pamoja na vidonge. Pande zote mbili za Muungano Prometheus Inakubalika,
# Unix Sekunde na RFC 3339, na mtu asiyelinganishwa anakataliwa badala ya
# kutikiswa, kwa sababu aina fulani ambayo haiwezi kupimwa haiwezi kufungwa.
# `--query.max-samples` Kwa makusudi anakaa unset: kupunguza ni ya kutosha
# jambo pia itafunga dashibodi za jukwaa mwenyewe, ambazo zinashiriki mfano,
# kwa hivyo dari ni juu ya maombi ya adapta badala ya kila mtu. Utawala ni wa
# kawaida - una funguo kwenye chombo kinachotangaza hoja tatu tofauti, sio kwa
# jina la jukumu - kwa hivyo upstream yenye umbo la baadaye hurithi.
msgid "[x] S3 adapters are restricted to declared bucket prefixes and list/head/get; Prometheus adapters enforce lookback/sample limits; GraphQL and SQL adapters reject arbitrary input languages. **Three of the four categories do not exist yet:** only `openapi_allowlist` (10 roles) and `mcp_passthrough` (4) are in use, and `test_mcp_schema.py` already requires exact `scope` names before an `s3_prefix`, `graphql_allowlist` or `named_query` adapter could ship. The Prometheus clause was real and is now half-closed: `prometheus_query_range` accepts client-chosen `start`, `end` and `step`, and the container ran with no `--query.timeout` at all, so a query the adapter abandoned after 15s kept Prometheus busy for its 2-minute default. The role now passes `--query.timeout` derived from `mcp.limits.timeout_seconds`, so the two cannot drift. **The lookback half is now closed too, and the sample ceiling is closed at the layer that can carry it.** `policy.assert_range` bounds a range query's point count by the contract's own `result_items`: a tool whose schema declares `start`, `end` and `step` has `(end - start) / step + 1` checked against that ceiling and is refused with `range_too_wide` and the smallest step that would fit. Against the live Prometheus contract, a day at one-minute resolution asks for 1441 points against a ceiling of 100 and is refused naming an 873-second step. The point is not politeness: the adapter already truncated such a response to 100 rows, so the upstream was scanning a range whose result was thrown away, and the timeout bounded only how long it did so. Both boundary forms Prometheus accepts are understood, unix seconds and RFC 3339, and an unparseable one is refused rather than waved through, because a range that cannot be measured cannot be bounded. `--query.max-samples` deliberately stays unset: lowering it far enough to matter would also bound the platform's own dashboards, which share the instance, so the ceiling belongs on the adapter's requests rather than on everyone's. The rule is generic — it keys on a tool declaring the three range arguments, not on a role name — so a future range-shaped upstream inherits it."
msgstr ""

