# x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x x
# x] [web-app-baserow](../../roles/web-app-baserow/) Inafungua seva ya MCP ya
# asili wakati `services.mcp.enabled=true`, hutumia utambulisho
# uliothibitishwa wa upendeleo na mkataba wa chombo cha kusoma tu, na
# kuthibitisha angalau chombo kimoja cha kuamua kupitia kila mteja
# aliyechaguliwa. **Hata hivyo, nusu ya msingi haiwezi kujengwa.**
# `provision_mcp.py` Kujenga nafasi ya kazi ya mmiliki wa mwisho
# `CoreHandler().create_workspace`, ambayo inafanya akaunti ya kazi ya ADMIN,
# na Baserow 2.3.3 Anajua tu `ADMIN` Aidha, na `MEMBER`
# (`backend/src/baserow/core/models.py`) - wote kuandika meza data, hivyo
# hakuna kusoma tu nafasi ya kazi ya demote. Taarifa ya
# `mutating_tools_enabled: false` Hivyo basi, hakuna haja ya kuwa na
# `create_rows`, Kwa hivyo, `update_rows` Aidha, na `delete_rows` Nenda kwenye
# orodha ya maombi. Uamuzi wa kurekebisha: mbele ya mwisho wa asili na
# `mcp_passthrough` adapta, ambaye mkataba wake unaondoa tu zana tatu za
# kuandika, kwa hivyo mteja anayemwita mmoja anakataliwa na
# `DENY_UNKNOWN_TOOL` Badala ya kufanya kazi katika mfumo wa MCP.
# `passthrough.py` Kukataa kupakia mkataba ambao unaorodhesha chombo cha
# kubadilisha wakati mabadiliko ni mbali - "Matangazo ya chombo ambacho
# hakiwezi kukimbia ni mbaya zaidi kuliko kutokuwa nayo" Kwa hiyo, mfumo huu
# ni wa kimfumo, na `filter_upstream_tools` Kupunguza kiwango cha juu
# `tools/list` Kwa jina, ambayo ina maana ya mkataba hauhitaji schemas chombo
# cha yake mwenyewe. **Kwa sasa mchezaji huyo ambaye ameondolewa mara mbili.**
# Baserow hutumikia usafiri wa kawaida wa HTTP + SSE, ambapo GET inafungua
# mkondo wa majibu na mkondo unatangaza URL ya pili kama kituo cha ombi,
# wakati adapta tu aliwahi kusema HTTP inayoweza kutiririka, ambayo hujibu
# POST kwa ombi moja. `files/python/sse.py` Anaongeza kwamba mteja, na uzi wa
# msomaji kwa sababu jibu la POST mara kwa mara huwasili kabla ya kurudi kwa
# POST, na mkataba huchagua kupitia `upstream_transport`, Kwa kushindwa
# `streamable_http` Kwa hivyo, hakuna mabadiliko ya mwenyeji. **Sasa hii ya
# Loliondo ipo.** Kamati hiyo imependekeza kuwa a `baserowmcp` Kamati ya
# Kudumu ya Bunge ambayo ina wajumbe wanne ambao ni
# [tools.json](../../roles/web-app-baserow/files/mcp/tools.json), Imetolewa na
# `schema_sha256`, na kuwafikisha mahakamani watuhumiwa hao kumi.
# `tools.upstream_serves`, hivyo bump toleo ambayo inawezesha mtu kuonyesha
# juu kama mkataba drift badala ya kama uso kimya widened. Mwisho wa mstari ni
# kama ifuatavyo `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_PATH_KEY` Na kwa kupitia kwake
# `policy.upstream_url`, Kwa hiyo, ni asilimia ngapi ya fedha hizo ambazo
# hazijaingizwa kwenye mkataba. `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` Inaboresha mfumo wa
# mizizi na inafungua njia ya kupanda. `list_databases`, ambayo ni chombo cha
# kuamua wito, juu ya kila kupeleka. Zanzibar ilikuwa sehemu ya mwisho
# kutangaza `endpoint.key_credential`, Kwa hiyo, kwa sasa mradi huu
# unatekelezwa, na `roles_with_service` Ukadiriaji na Plugin ya ugunduzi:
# sehemu ya URL haiwezi kupitiwa kwa watumiaji au kufutwa peke yake, hivyo
# mtoa huduma anayethibitisha njia hiyo ni nyuma ya adapta badala ya usanidi
# wa mteja. Kipengele kilichobaki, wito wa kuwasili kutoka kwa kila mteja
# aliyechaguliwa badala ya kutoka kwa uchunguzi, ni kigezo cha mwisho hadi
# mwisho hapa chini.
msgid "[x] [web-app-baserow](../../roles/web-app-baserow/) exposes its native MCP server when `services.mcp.enabled=true`, uses a verified least-privilege identity and read-only tool contract, and verifies at least one deterministic tool call through each selected client. **The least-privilege half cannot hold as built.** `provision_mcp.py` creates the endpoint owner's workspace with `CoreHandler().create_workspace`, which makes that account the workspace ADMIN, and Baserow 2.3.3 knows only `ADMIN` and `MEMBER` (`backend/src/baserow/core/models.py`) — both write table data, so there is no read-only workspace role to demote to. The declared `mutating_tools_enabled: false` therefore bounds nothing, and `create_rows`, `update_rows` and `delete_rows` sit in the served allowlist. Decided fix: front the native endpoint with the `mcp_passthrough` adapter, whose contract simply omits the three write tools, so a client calling one is refused with `DENY_UNKNOWN_TOOL` rather than writing into the MCP workspace. `passthrough.py` refuses to load a contract that lists a mutating tool while mutations are off — \"advertising a tool that cannot run is worse than not having it\" — so omission is the mechanism, and `filter_upstream_tools` narrows the upstream `tools/list` by name, which means the contract needs no tool schemas of its own. **The blocker that reverted this twice is now removed.** Baserow serves the classic HTTP+SSE transport, where a GET opens the response stream and the stream announces a second URL as the request channel, while the adapter only ever spoke Streamable HTTP, which answers a POST on the same request. `files/python/sse.py` adds that client, with a reader thread because the answer to a POST regularly arrives before the POST returns, and the contract selects it through `upstream_transport`, defaulting to `streamable_http` so no existing provider changes. **That wiring is now in place.** The role deploys a `baserowmcp` sidecar whose contract serves the four read tools of [tools.json](../../roles/web-app-baserow/files/mcp/tools.json), pinned by `schema_sha256`, and lists the ten it refuses under `tools.upstream_serves`, so a version bump that enables one shows up as contract drift instead of as a silently widened surface. The endpoint key reaches the sidecar as `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_PATH_KEY` and is spliced in by `policy.upstream_url`, which percent-encodes it, so it never enters the rendered contract. `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` rebuilds the sidecar and runs the adapter probe against it with `list_databases`, which is the deterministic tool call, on every deploy. Baserow was the last role declaring `endpoint.key_credential`, and that field is now gone from the schema, the `roles_with_service` projection and the discovery plugin: a URL segment cannot be scoped per consumer or revoked alone, so a provider that authenticates that way belongs behind an adapter rather than in a client's rendered configuration. The remaining clause, the call arriving from each selected client rather than from the probe, is the end-to-end criterion below."
msgstr ""

