msgid "`$wgAWSBucketDomain` is the public `objstore.public_url` (scheme, the provider's canonical API domain and the bucket path). The extension appends the zone root directory to it and prefixes `https://` only when the value carries no scheme, so a path-style value renders `…/<bucket>/thumb` correctly. `services.seaweedfs.public: true` grants the anonymous `Read` on that bucket the browser needs to fetch those URLs."
