msgid "`$wgAWSCredentials`, `$wgAWSRegion` and `$wgAWSBucketName` come from `lookup('objstore', application_id, …)`, so the wiki signs with its own per-consumer identity from the engine's `s3.json`."
msgstr ""

msgid "`$wgEnableUploads` follows the same flag. Extension:AWS only replaces `$wgLocalFileRepo`; it opens no upload surface of its own, so without the object store the wiki keeps its uploads switched off rather than filling the local `images` volume."
