# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — newline-separated workflow paths, the members of the concurrency group being backed up. Without it the helpers would also cancel runs the group never governed, such as the `cron-*` workflows that listen on `push`. Derive the list from the `concurrency:` blocks, not from what looks related: `entry-delete-branch.yml` keys its group on the *deleted* ref, so it is not a member of a push's group, and listing it would make a push to `main` cancel an unrelated branch cleanup. A value that lists no path at all aborts rather than silently matching nothing."
msgstr "`INCLUDE_PATHS` - Njia mpya za kazi zilizotengwa, wanachama wa kikundi cha ushirika wanaungwa mkono. Bila ya hivyo, wasaidizi pia wataondoa uongozi ambao haujawahi kutawala, kama vile `cron-*` Kazi za sanaa zinazosikiliza `push`. Unda orodha ya kuingia `concurrency:` Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi. .................................................................... `entry-delete-branch.yml` wa chama chake katika *Iliondolewa* ref, hivyo si mwanachama wa kikundi cha kushinikiza, na orodha itafanya kushinikiza `main` Kusafisha sehemu isiyo na uhusiano. Thamani ambayo haiorodhesha njia yoyote katika utoaji wa mimba badala ya kulinganisha kimya."

