msgid "`Jira <https://www.atlassian.com/>`__ is Atlassian’s issue and project-tracking platform. This role deploys Jira via Docker Compose, connects it to PostgreSQL, and adds proxy awareness, optional OIDC SSO, health checks, and production-oriented defaults for Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "`Jira <https://www.atlassian.com/>`__ Ni suala la Atlassian na jukwaa la kufuatilia mradi. Wajibu huu unatekelezwa Jira Kwa kupitia Docker ComposeKuunganisha kwa PostgreSQL, na kuongeza ufahamu wa wakala, OIDC SSO ya hiari, ukaguzi wa afya, na default-oriented uzalishaji kwa Infinito.Nexus..."

# wazi, jukwaa la mkutano wa video wa mwisho-kwa-mwisho. Vyumba
# vinavyoendeshwa juu ya WebRTC na Kitengo cha Uchaguzi wa Kati (wa wa wa), ya
# ya ya XMPP server server server server server server server server server
# server server server server server server server server server server server
# server server server server server (Kwa bahati mbaya) kwa ajili ya mkutano,
# na lengo la mkutano daemon (ya jico)...
msgid "`Jitsi Meet <https://jitsi.org/>`__ is an open-source, end-to-end-encryptable video conferencing platform. Rooms run over WebRTC with a central Selective Forwarding Unit (jvb), an XMPP server (prosody) for signalling, and a conference focus daemon (jicofo)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Joomla <https://www.joomla.org/>`__ is a free and open-source content management system that lets users build and run websites, intranets, and online applications without writing code. It exposes a component, module, and plugin architecture that authors and developers extend with custom content types, layouts, and integrations."
msgstr "`Joomla <https://www.joomla.org/>`__ Ni mfumo wa usimamizi wa maudhui ya bure na wazi ambayo inaruhusu watumiaji kujenga na kuendesha tovuti, intranets, na programu za mtandaoni bila msimbo wa kuandika. Inafunua sehemu, moduli, na usanifu wa Plugin ambayo waandishi na watengenezaji wanapanua na aina za maudhui ya desturi, mipangilio, na ushirikiano."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jrnl <https://jrnl.sh/>`__ is a simple and effective command-line journal application that allows users to create and manage personal journal entries."
msgstr "`Jrnl <https://jrnl.sh/>`__ Ni programu rahisi na yenye ufanisi ya jarida la amri ambayo inaruhusu watumiaji kuunda na kusimamia maingilio ya jarida la kibinafsi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Jupyter <https://jupyter.org/>`__ runs code in a managed kernel and returns its output. This role provides that kernel as a backend for other services rather than as a notebook UI for people."
msgstr "`Jupyter <https://jupyter.org/>`__ Inaendesha msimbo katika kernel iliyosimamiwa na inarudi pato lake. Jukumu hili hutoa kernel kama backend kwa huduma nyingine badala ya kama daftari UI kwa watu."

# tukio la kikundi hai na hufuta tu wale wazee, ambayo ni kanuni ambayo
# kikundi cha kukubaliana kinatumika. Ni nini hufanya kuanguka salama dhidi ya
# jamii: kichwa SHA kutoka kwenye mzigo wa malipo ya tukio huenda stale wakati
# kazi kusubiri kwa mkimbiaji, na SHA kichwa kutoka kwa mzigo wa tukio huenda
# stale wakati kazi inasubiri mkimbiaji, na `[skip ci]` au au au au
# `GITHUB_TOKEN` Kusukuma hatua ncha ya tawi bila kuunda kukimbia kabisa.
# Kuchagua kwa "Sio kichwa cha sasa" Kisha ataondoa CI mpya zaidi ya kufanya
# na kuacha ngazi moja, au kuacha tawi bila CI kabisa. Kuchagua kwa "Sio njia
# mpya ya" Haiwezi, kwa amri yoyote.
msgid "`KEEP_NEWEST_PER` — keeps the newest run of each group instance alive and cancels only the older ones, which is the rule the concurrency group itself applies. It is what makes the fallback safe against races: the head SHA from the event payload goes stale while the job waits for a runner, and a `[skip ci]` or `GITHUB_TOKEN` push moves the branch tip without creating a run at all. Selecting by \"not the current head\" would then cancel the newest commit's CI and spare the stale one, or leave the branch with no CI at all. Selecting by \"not the newest run\" cannot, in any ordering."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KEY` MUST be the owned variable's name."
msgstr "`KEY` Inapaswa kuwa jina la kikoa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KIX Start <https://www.kixdesk.com/>`__ is an open-source IT service management and helpdesk platform forked from OTRS. It provides ticket management, configuration management, knowledge base, and reporting for IT service teams."
msgstr "`KIX Start <https://www.kixdesk.com/>`__ Ni usimamizi wa huduma ya IT ya chanzo wazi na jukwaa la Helpdesk linalotolewa kutoka OTRS. Inatoa usimamizi wa tiketi, usimamizi wa usanidi, msingi wa ujuzi, na taarifa kwa timu za huduma za IT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Kata Containers <https://katacontainers.io/>`__ is an OCI container runtime that starts each container inside a lightweight virtual machine with its own kernel instead of sharing the host kernel. `gVisor <https://gvisor.dev/>`__ is a second isolating runtime, shipped as the single ``runsc`` binary, that intercepts container syscalls in a userspace kernel and runs without hardware virtualization."
msgstr "`Kata Containers <https://katacontainers.io/>`__ Ni runtime ya chombo cha OCI ambayo huanza kila chombo ndani ya mashine nyepesi ya kawaida na kernel yake mwenyewe badala ya kugawana kernel ya jeshi. `gVisor <https://gvisor.dev/>`__ Ni mara ya pili mfululizo, kama ilivyo kawaida. ``runsc`` binary, kwamba inazuia syscalls chombo katika kernel userspace na anaendesha bila virtualization vifaa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`KeePassXC <https://keepassxc.org/>`__ is a free, open-source, cross-platform password manager that stores credentials in an encrypted local database compatible with the KeePass format."
msgstr "`KeePassXC <https://keepassxc.org/>`__ ni bure, chanzo cha wazi, meneja wa nenosiri wa jukwaa la msalaba ambao huhifadhi sifa katika database ya ndani iliyosimbwa sambamba na muundo wa KeePass."

