msgid "``--matrix`` renders the full ordered candidate list, so the matrix order IS the selection priority. Every human-facing view of that list goes through here rather than re-deriving the sort and the filter: hand-rolling ``--sort \"$INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SORT\" --filter \"compose == true\"`` reads the wrong column (``compose`` is what a role can do, ``test_compose`` is what CI tests), which silently shows an order no run will ever take."
msgstr "``--matrix`` Inatoa orodha kamili ya mgombea, kwa hivyo utaratibu wa matrix ni kipaumbele cha uteuzi. Kila mtazamo wa kibinadamu wa orodha hiyo unapitia hapa badala ya kurekebisha aina na chujio: kujiandikisha kwa mkono ``--sort \"$INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SORT\" --filter \"compose == true\"`` Angalia ukurasa wa makosa (``compose`` Ni kazi gani unaweza kufanya, ``test_compose`` Ni nini maana ya majaribio), ambayo inaonyesha amri hakuna kukimbia milele kuchukua."

