msgstr "`allow`: kabla ya kuruhusiwa. Aidha, `sandbox.autoAllowBashIfSandboxed: true` Kabla ya kuruhusiwa amri yoyote Bash kwamba anaendesha sandboxed na mechi hakuna `deny`Kwa hivyo`ask` ya utawala. Agents bila sawa OS ngazi sandbox lazima kutibu Bash unmatched kama `ask`..."

