msgstr "`source_url` Aidha, na `notes` Lazima uonyeshe kiwango cha juu cha skrini. Wanaishi katika jukumu kwa sababu jukumu linawamiliki; mabaki ya ukaguzi hupata safu zake za kuthibitishwa kutoka hapa na haipaswi kuweka nakala ya pili. Idadi ya tafsiri sio hapa: toleo lililotumika tayari linaishi katika `meta/services.yml`, na nakala ya pili katika `meta/mcp.yml` Rekodi tu wakati mtu alionekana mwisho, ambayo hakuna utekelezaji na hakuna watumiaji kusoma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`source` (required) MUST be one of `upstream` (installed from the app's own registry), `bundled` (ships with the image), `vendored` (committed under `roles/<role>/files/`), or `built` (compiled/zipped during the play, e.g. the Joomla OIDC plugin)."
msgstr "`source` (Mahitaji inahitajika) Lazima kuwa mmoja wa `upstream` (Kujiandikisha kutoka kwa Usajili wa App)Kwa hivyo, `bundled` (Meli zilizo na picha)Kwa hivyo, `vendored` (Imetolewa chini ya `roles/<role>/files/`)Kwa hivyo, au `built` (wakati wa mchezo, kwa mfano. Joomla Plugin ya OIDC)..."

msgid "`source` is resolved relative to `applications.<role>`; only `users.<key>.<attr>` points to the global users. The role reads every managed value from the `source` its `meta/forms.yml` names, so the lock and the convergence cannot name different fields. `WORDPRESS_OPTIONS_CONTRIBUTED` and `services.sso.profile.locked` move into `meta/forms.yml`."
