msgid "`svc-ai-robot` stays out of the platform list. It runs the same agent in embodied mode, which means it drops the isolating runtime on purpose and hands the container the host devices it is meant to drive. A broker platform is defined by the opposite: `runsc`, no host device, no host mount. Serving an embodied agent per user would either break that invariant or ship a robot that cannot reach its hardware."
msgstr "`svc-ai-robot` Weka nje ya orodha ya jukwaa. Inaendesha wakala mmoja katika hali iliyojumuishwa, ambayo inamaanisha inaacha kukimbia kwa makusudi na mikono chombo vifaa vya jeshi vinavyomaanisha kuendesha. Jukwaa la broker linafafanuliwa kwa kinyume: `runsc`, Hakuna chombo cha mwenyeji, hakuna mlima wa mwenyeji. Kutumikia wakala aliyejumuishwa kwa mtumiaji inaweza kuvunja kwamba invariant au meli robot ambayo haiwezi kufikia vifaa vyake."

