msgid "`tasks/01_setup.yml:30` passes `lookup('users', 'platform_administrator').password` to `mmctl --local user create --password` on the command line, where the process list of the node shows it (read from the task; `mmctl` reads a password from standard input only for `user change-password`). Options: create the account with a random throwaway password and set the real one through `mmctl --local user change-password` fed on standard input; or create the account through the local API socket."
