msgstr "`test_e2e_playwright_skip_roles` (Kwa default: `[]`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_network_create_via_util.py` requires that role tasks creating Docker networks route through the shared utility, never inline `community.docker.docker_network` calls."
msgstr "`test_network_create_via_util.py` Inahitaji kwamba kazi za jukumu kujenga njia ya mitandao ya Docker kupitia matumizi ya pamoja, kamwe inline `community.docker.docker_network` ya simu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_inline_multiline_sql.py` caps inline multi-line SQL in Ansible tasks at three lines. Larger statements MUST live in a dedicated `.sql` file under the role's `files/` directory and be loaded explicitly so linters, formatters, and database tooling can operate on them."
msgstr "`test_no_inline_multiline_sql.py` Tumia SQL Inline multi-line katika kazi za Ansible kwa mistari mitatu. Maneno muhimu zaidi yahitajika katika kazi ya kujitolea `.sql` Picha chini ya jukumu hilo `files/` saraka na kubeba wazi linters, formatters, na tooling database inaweza kufanya kazi juu yao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_jinja_default_on_spot_path.py` forbids `| default(...)` on Jinja expressions whose path resolves via `group_vars/all/*.yml`. Those keys are loaded unconditionally, so the default is dead code at best and silent SPOT decoupling at worst. Per-line suppression: `# nocheck: spot-default`."
msgstr "`test_no_jinja_default_on_spot_path.py` Kuzuia `| default(...)` kwa maneno ya Jinja ambayo njia yake ya kutatua `group_vars/all/*.yml`. funguo hizo ni kubeba bila masharti, hivyo default ni wafu code katika bora na kimya SPOT decoupling katika mbaya zaidi. Ukandamizaji wa mtandao: `# nocheck: spot-default`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_legacy_get_url_module_usage.py` forbids the unqualified `get_url:` module name; tasks MUST use `ansible.builtin.get_url`."
msgstr "`test_no_legacy_get_url_module_usage.py` Kukataliwa kwa wasio na sifa `get_url:` Jina la moduli; majukumu ya kutumia `ansible.builtin.get_url`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_legacy_uri_module_usage.py` forbids the unqualified `uri:` module name; tasks MUST use `ansible.builtin.uri`."
msgstr "`test_no_legacy_uri_module_usage.py` Kukataliwa kwa wasio na sifa `uri:` Jina la moduli; majukumu ya kutumia `ansible.builtin.uri`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_literal_no_log.py` forbids literal `no_log: true` / `no_log: false`; every gate MUST flow through the `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` variable."
msgstr "`test_no_literal_no_log.py` Kukataa kwa usahihi `no_log: true` Kwa hivyo `no_log: false`; Kila mlango lazima ufunguliwe. `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` kubadilika."

# `lookup('config', application_id, 'path') | default(X)`. Kwa kipindi cha
# miaka miwili `config` a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a
# a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a
# a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a `default(...)` Filter
# kamwe moto; kuanguka lazima kupita kama hoja ya tatu ya lookup badala yake.
msgid "`test_no_lookup_config_jinja_default.py` forbids `lookup('config', application_id, 'path') | default(X)`. The two-term `config` lookup raises on a missing key, so the Jinja `default(...)` filter never fires; the fallback MUST be passed as the lookup's third argument instead."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_redundant_default_on_module_io.py` forbids `| default(...)` on a task's own `register:` output or input arguments inside its own conditionals, where the value is provably set."
msgstr "`test_no_redundant_default_on_module_io.py` Kuzuia `| default(...)` Kwa upande wa majukumu ya `register:` uzalishaji au pembejeo hoja ndani ya masharti yake mwenyewe, ambapo thamani ni dhahiri kuweka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_sh_lc_pipefail.py` requires that every `sh -lc '...'` invocation containing a `|` pipeline starts with `set -o pipefail`, so failures mid-pipeline propagate."
msgstr "`test_no_sh_lc_pipefail.py` Hii inahitaji kila mmoja `sh -lc '...'` Katika maombi hayo ambayo `|` Bomba huanza na `set -o pipefail`, Kwa hivyo, kushindwa katikati yapipeline propagate."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_sh_pipefail_in_ansible_tasks.py` requires that Ansible `shell:` tasks stay on Bash and use Bash's `set -o pipefail` form, not the POSIX-`sh` workaround."
msgstr "`test_no_sh_pipefail_in_ansible_tasks.py` Hii inahitaji tahadhari `shell:` Kazi katika Bash na kutumia Bash `set -o pipefail` Picha zote na Wizara ya Mambo ya Ndani ya Nchi. ....................................................................`sh` kufanya kazi."

msgid "`test_package_batch.py` requires that a role's own `package_install` tasks install only ids flagged `batch: false` in `meta/packages.yml`, that every id of a role the constructor runs before the deploy-start batch carries that flag, and that a `shared: true` reference names a root id."
msgstr ""

# Keys `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` Aidha, na `group_vars/**/*.yml`
# Kwa kila mradi `.yml` Kwa hivyo `.yaml` Kwa hivyo `.j2` ya faili. Msingi wa
# utawala ni `unused-var` (kuona kuona kuona
# [suppression.md](../../../../docs/contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))...
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`test_role_and_group_vars_used.py` scans top-level keys of `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` and `group_vars/**/*.yml` against every project `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` file. The suppression rule key is `unused-var` (see [suppression.md](../../../../docs/contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_run_once_tags.py` requires that every `set_fact` marked `run_once: true` carries the canonical run-once tags so re-runs and `--tags` filters keep the fact populated."
msgstr "`test_run_once_tags.py` Hii inahitaji kila mmoja `set_fact` Alama ya alama `run_once: true` -Kuweka alama za vidole mara kwa mara, na `--tags` Filters huhifadhi ukweli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_sed_escape.py` requires that any Jinja-templated replacement passed to `sed` flows through the `sed_escape` filter so substitutions with regex metacharacters land literally."
msgstr "`test_sed_escape.py` kuhakikisha kuwa kila Mtanzania anayetoka nje ya `sed` kupitia kwa `sed_escape` filter hivyo substitutions na regex metacharacters ardhi literally."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_service_shared_consistency.py` enforces that every service whose `meta/services.yml` entry marks it `shared: true` exposes the required role-side bindings, and the inverse: a role consuming the shared form MUST declare the corresponding flag in its `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "`test_service_shared_consistency.py` kuhakikisha kuwa kila mtumishi ambaye `meta/services.yml` Kuingia alama `shared: true` Inafichua vifungo vinavyohitajika vya upande, na kinyume: jukumu linalotumia fomu ya pamoja LAZIMA kutangaza bendera inayolingana katika yake `meta/services.yml`..."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_vars_usage_in_yaml.py` scans task-level `vars:` blocks against the same consumer set. The two scanners never overlap because their declaration shapes differ."
msgstr "`test_vars_usage_in_yaml.py` Skanning ya kiwango cha kazi `vars:` dhidi ya wafanyabiashara hao waliosajiliwa. skanning mbili kamwe kuingiliana kwa sababu maumbo yao tamko tofauti."

