# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`transport` MUST default to `streamable_http` for server deployments. Stdio MAY exist only for local development and MUST NOT be enabled in a deployed web role by default."
msgstr "`transport` Lazima kuwa default `streamable_http` kwa ajili ya matumizi ya server. Stdio inaweza kuwepo tu kwa maendeleo ya ndani na haipaswi kuwezeshwa katika jukumu la mtandao uliotumiwa kwa default."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`transport` accepts `streamable_http` and `sse` only. A stdio MCP server is a local process the client spawns, so it inherits the client container's filesystem and network with no endpoint to authenticate, no proxy to route through, and nothing for a probe to reach. Every property the other rules rely on (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) is undefined for it. Clients that support stdio are pinned away from it in their own role: Flowise sets `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` so no flow can spawn a command."
msgstr "`transport` Kuwakubali `streamable_http` Aidha, na `sse` ya pekee. Stdio MCP seva ni mchakato wa ndani wa mazao ya mteja, kwa hivyo inarithi mfumo wa faili wa mteja na mtandao bila mwisho wa kuthibitisha, hakuna wakala wa njia kupitia, na hakuna kitu cha uchunguzi wa kufikia. Kila moja ya kanuni nyingine hutegemea (`auth`, Kwa hivyo, `exposure`, Kwa hivyo, `endpoint`) Ni undefined kwa ajili yake. Wateja ambao msaada stdio ni pinned mbali na hilo katika jukumu lao wenyewe: Flowise seti `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` Kwa hivyo, hakuna njia ya mkato ya kuingia."

